","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tejasprasad2008-afk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tejasprasad2008-afk/TraceTree/commits/6ce1b7f142a45e704e25160414c8931793f37290/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T16:24:46Z","email":"tejasprasad2008@gmail.com","name":"Tejas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T16:24:46Z","email":"tejasprasad2008@gmail.com","name":"Tejas"},"message":"fix: resolve merge conflicts and fix 5 PR reviewer bugs\n\n- monitor/utils.py: add uname/lsb_release to shared BENIGN_BINARIES\n- monitor/parser.py: resolve merge conflict (remove local BENIGN_BINARIES\n  duplicate — now imported from utils); remove mprotect PROT_EXEC from\n  suspicious_flags (keep severity 3.0, not flagged for every shared lib load)\n- monitor/timeline.py: resolve merge conflict (keep benign execve filter\n  for burst_process_spawn); deduplicate import statements\n- ml/trainer.py: move google.cloud.storage to lazy import (fixes\n  ModuleNotFoundError offline); add clear_model_cache import to CSV\n  fast-path (fixes NameError); add skip_gcs param to train_model()\n- ml/detector.py: pass skip_gcs=True in _auto_train_or_baseline so\n  analyze never triggers cloud upload\n- sandbox/sandbox.py: wrap subprocess.run in try/finally so temp script\n  is always deleted even on subprocess failure\n- monitor/scanner.py: tighten noscan regex to require actual comment\n  syntax (prevents string literal bypass)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e58cd193e1fd67105e8a2a00a5364ec1c1c69d0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tejasprasad2008-afk/TraceTree/git/trees/e58cd193e1fd67105e8a2a00a5364ec1c1c69d0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tejasprasad2008-afk/TraceTree/git/commits/6ce1b7f142a45e704e25160414c8931793f37290","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent