ttps://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IzeroCs","id":17359499,"login":"IzeroCs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzU5NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/577a1616e6bfc430fb3965bc25d8571f12ecd3fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T09:38:07Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T09:38:07Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"message":"feat(backend): let an addon look up who exists on the desktop\n\nAn addon only ever receives a numeric user id through OAuthTokenResult, so\nit cannot render a \"share with whom?\" picker. Add SearchUsers (empty query\nlists the directory, limit clamped to [1,200], new offset) and GetUsers\n(resolve ids the addon already stored, 50 per call).\n\nReverses the old rule that refused queries under two characters: a picker\nlists rather than searches, and hiding names buys nothing when the caller\nalready holds a machine token. Email stays a match key that is never echoed\nback. Both RPCs are additive; the proto gains 50 lines and loses none.","tree":{"sha":"f544a9a6d8d987b55c02182784c1b54edc522ae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/trees/f544a9a6d8d987b55c02182784c1b54edc522ae8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/commits/577a1616e