m","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"message":"chore(version): bump Namorix.Core 0.68.0 + Namorix.Server 0.86.0\n\nBoth MINOR: Core adds members to a public interface (0.x allows the break\nat MINOR), Server changes auth behaviour rather than a pure fix.","tree":{"sha":"7cb37eca401f99fad9437171a160d72e8d671573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/trees/7cb37eca401f99fad9437171a160d72e8d671573"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/commits/d033cedc890face80b927552eab00a033fc4bb6c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17359499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IzeroCs","id":17359499,"login":"IzeroCs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzU5NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Namorix/namorix/commit/d033cedc890face80b927552eab00a033fc4bb6c","node_id":"C_kwDORssok9oAKGQwMzNjZWRjODkwZmFjZTgwYjkyNzU1MmVhYjAwYTAzM2ZjNGJiNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Namorix/namorix/commit/bad0e1cf5c7d515487f1becb93106f8e4b6bb985","sha":"bad0e1cf5c7d515487f1becb93106f8e4b6bb985","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/bad0e1cf5c7d515487f1becb93106f8e4b6bb985"}],"sha":"d033cedc890face80b927552eab00a033fc4bb6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/d033cedc890face80b927552eab00a033fc4bb6c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17359499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IzeroCs","id":17359499,"login":"IzeroCs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzU5NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/bad0e1cf5c7d515487f1becb93106f8e4b6bb985/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T10:35:39Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T10:35:39Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"message":"feat(backend)!: prune addon grants the token store cannot reach\n\nEvery delete path in AddonTokenStore is scoped to the current ClientId,\nand there was no expiry sweep at all, so a row left behind by an earlier\nClientId was unreachable and stayed in the table forever.\n\nAdd AddonTokenCleanupWorker: one sweep at start, then every 24h.\n- DeleteExpiredAsync drops grants whose refresh credential ran out.\n- DeleteOtherClientsAsync drops grants from a ClientId the addon no\n  longer holds, and only runs once oauth.ClientId is known -- it is null\n  until the channel authenticates, and deleting on an unknown id would\n  take every grant the addon has.\n\nBREAKING: IAddonTokenStore gains two members, so any addon implementing\nthe interface itself will no longer compile. Only AddonTokenStore<TContext>\nimplements it today.","tree":{"sha":"28f2fe3c5fcbb8f625574aa74451a5b554b1670e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/trees/28f2fe3c5fcbb8f625574aa74451a5b554b1670e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/commits/bad0e1cf5c7d515487f1becb93106f8e4b6bb985","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17359499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IzeroCs","id":17359499,"login":"IzeroCs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzU5NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Namorix/namorix/commit/bad0e1cf5c7d515487f1becb93106f8e4b6bb985","node_id":"C_kwDORssok9oAKGJhZDBlMWNmNWM3ZDUxNTQ4N2YxYmVjYjkzMTA2ZjhlNGI2YmI5ODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Namorix/namorix/commit/ef4a744be8ac1ea096a2810682d0c14bdba478c4","sha":"ef4a744be8ac1ea096a2810682d0c14bdba478c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/ef4a744be8ac1ea096a2810682d0c14bdba478c4"}],"sha":"bad0e1cf5c7d515487f1becb93106f8e4b6bb985","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/bad0e1cf5c7d515487f1becb93106f8e4b6bb985"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17359499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IzeroCs","id":17359499,"login":"IzeroCs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzU5NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/ef4a744be8ac1ea096a2810682d0c14bdba478c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T10:35:39Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T10:35:39Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"message":"fix(backend): treat invalid_client as a fatal refresh failure\n\nThe addon middleware kept the cookie and answered 503 for every refresh\nerror that was not invalid_grant or theft_detected.\n\ninvalid_client means the desktop no longer knows that ClientId, so the\ncookie can never be refreshed again no matter how often the browser\nretries. Answering 503 forever left the user deleting cookies by hand\nto get back in. Drop the grant and clear the cookie instead.","tree":{"sha":"f7fb9faffe2197a6cc083434597a9c5755212bb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/trees/f7fb9faffe2197a6cc083434597a9c5755212bb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/commits/ef4a744be8ac1ea096a2810682d0c14bdba478c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17359499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IzeroCs","id":17359499,"login":"IzeroCs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzU5NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Namorix/namorix/commit/ef4a744be8ac1ea096a2810682d0c14bdba478c4","node_id":"C_kwDORssok9oAKGVmNGE3NDRiZThhYzFlYTA5NmEyODEwNjgyZDBjMTRiZGJhNDc4YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Namorix/namorix/commit/2d03bcbe50c5f519ace38a036f2f03c3b26b18bd","sha":"2d03bcbe50c5f519ace38a036f2f03c3b26b18bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/2d03bcbe50c5f519ace38a036f2f03c3b26b18bd"}],"sha":"ef4a744be8ac1ea096a2810682d0c14bdba478c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/ef4a744be8ac1ea096a2810682d0c14bdba478c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17359499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IzeroCs","id":17359499,"login":"IzeroCs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzU5NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/2d03bcbe50c5f519ace38a036f2f03c3b26b18bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T10:35:39Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T10:35:39Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"message":"fix(backend): keep the addon''s ClientId across re-registration\n\nRegisterClientAsync minted a fresh Guid on every call. An addon\nre-registers on every update, because updating rotates its registration\ntoken, so the installation''s ClientId changed out from under the grants\nand the session cookies users were already holding.\n\nReturn the existing id when the installation already has one; only the\nfirst registration mints a new one. PublicKey is still refreshed, since\nre-registering is how an addon rolls its key.\n\nThis is the invariant UpdateAsync already claimed to hold (\"the new\ncontainer has to inherit the grants the old one held\") -- rotating the\nid broke it, and the mismatch only surfaced later, as a\nPermissionDenied \"ClientId mismatch\" loop on the addon''s next refresh.","tree":{"sha":"92ffd7088480dfd74d3a278fdc8700203a37e08f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/trees/92ffd7088480dfd74d3a278fdc8700203a37e08f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/commits/2d03bcbe50c5f519ace38a036f2f03c3b26b18bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17359499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IzeroCs","id":17359499,"login":"IzeroCs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzU5NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Namorix/namorix/commit/2d03bcbe50c5f519ace38a036f2f03c3b26b18bd","node_id":"C_kwDORssok9oAKDJkMDNiY2JlNTBjNWY1MTlhY2UzOGEwMzZmMmYwM2MzYjI2YjE4YmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Namorix/namorix/commit/b42c863d26cdfea1f55eb42ec285c4b3bccd56d5","sha":"b42c863d26cdfea1f55eb42ec285c4b3bccd56d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/b42c863d26cdfea1f55eb42ec285c4b3bccd56d5"}],"sha":"2d03bcbe50c5f519ace38a036f2f03c3b26b18bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/2d03bcbe50c5f519ace38a036f2f03c3b26b18bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17359499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IzeroCs","id":17359499,"login":"IzeroCs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzU5NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/b42c863d26cdfea1f55eb42ec285c4b3bccd56d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T09:41:35Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T09:41:35Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"message":"docs: record the addon update flow\n\nAlso corrects the addon endpoint table in backend/README.md, which had the\nwrong prefix, the wrong auth level on the mutating routes, and a stale\nuninstall method.","tree":{"sha":"3fb790d5a6a06c1878a83e48f18dec0deebe88b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/trees/3fb790d5a6a06c1878a83e48f18dec0deebe88b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/commits/b42c863d26cdfea1f55eb42ec285c4b3bccd56d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17359499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/I