  default AddonSessionAuthOptions.CallbackPath — hai đầu không lệch nhau.\n- Xoá đường HTTP legacy: POST /api/oauth/token/refresh + SetAddonRefreshTokenCookie;\n  POST /api/oauth/token co lại chỉ còn client_credentials vì code redeem qua gRPC\n  ExchangeUserCode. Xoá Cookie.AddonRefreshToken, OAuthEndpoints.TokenRefresh và các\n  field Code/CodeVerifier/ClientId của TokenRequest. Addon ngoài nào tự gọi\n  authorization_code qua HTTP phải chuyển sang gRPC.\n- DG9: Callback trả 403 cho access_denied (request hiểu được nhưng bị từ chối) thay vì\n  400 — FE addon phân nhánh theo status cần lưu ý.","tree":{"sha":"441d16ae83285a49c5aca9e04c4669c984558605","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/trees/441d16ae83285a49c5aca9e04c4669c984558605"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/commits/5e765986d85c7129053dd7cb2f103747d77ad455","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17359499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IzeroCs","id":17359499,"login":"IzeroCs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzU5NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Namorix/namorix/commit/5e765986d85c7129053dd7cb2f103747d77ad