s://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/9279a118c6dc1f69a349a5cd66bffebaaa060790/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T03:52:26Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T03:52:26Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"message":"feat(backend): addon OAuth Phase 2 — revoke theo user + push session-revoked/session-grants\n\n- RevokeTokenAsync returns OAuthRevokedGrant(AddonId, ClientId, UserId); tries the\n  hinted table first, then the other, since token_type_hint is only advisory\n- RevokeChainAsync scopes revocation to (userId, clientId) per DG6, and\n  RevokeAddonTokensForUserAsync covers every client of a user\n- 30s refresh-reuse grace window: the successor pair is stored encrypted on the\n  consumed row and replayed on retry, so a lost response is not read as theft\n- AuthController.Logout/LogoutAll revoke the refresh token to resolve its owner,\n  then broadcast session-revoked to that user''s addons\n- OAuthController.Revoke pushes SessionRevoked instead of DisconnectAsync, since\n  one addon process can host several clients\n- AddonChannelService sends session-grants on every (re)connect so a revoke that\n  happened while the addon was offline is repaired instead of waited on\n- AddonChannelClient gains OnMessageAsync, ActiveGrantUserIds and MarkStreamDown\n- Migration 20260914031757_AddOAuthRefreshTokenRotationSuccessor (3 successor columns)","tree":{"sha":"7e1304dc76e15e05ca564ff163ed5e7c8d797ff6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/trees/7e1304dc76e15e05ca564ff