66632e5fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T03:09:33Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T03:09:33Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"message":"chore(version): bump Namorix.Core 0.63.0 + Namorix.Server 0.81.0\n\n- Core gains the addon token contract (OAuth constants, GetJwks RPC, ref-counted session\n  lock); Server gains the signing implementation and JWT issuance.","tree":{"sha":"e6905a964f58a460f6919a042916ee9cdd660ecd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/trees/e6905a964f58a460f6919a042916ee9cdd660ecd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/commits/e44df7fbcb5be0b6e012681c5e2ee9e66632e5fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17359499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IzeroCs","id":17359499,"login":"IzeroCs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzU5NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Namorix/namorix/commit/e44df7fbcb5be0b6e012681c5e2ee9e66632e5fb","node_id":"C_kwDORssok9oAKGU0NGRmN2ZiY2I1YmUwYjZlMDEyNjgxYzVlMmVlOWU2NjYzMmU1ZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Namorix/namorix/commit/f5050e60265ce1e0f5e091bf46f507db8f0beafe","sha":"f5050e60265ce1e0f5e091bf46f507db8f0beafe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/f5050e60265ce1e0f5e091bf46f507db8f0beafe"}],"sha":"e44df7fbcb5be0b6e012681c5e2ee9e66632e5fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/e44df7fbcb5be0b6e012681c5e2ee9e66632e5fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17359499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IzeroCs","id":17359499,"login":"IzeroCs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzU5NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/f5050e60265ce1e0f5e091bf46f507db8f0beafe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T03:09:33Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T03:09:33Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"message":"feat(backend): addon OAuth — JWT RS256 access token, JWKS over gRPC, fail-closed gate\n\n- Sign addon access tokens with RSA (NmxAddonTokenSigner, kid = base64url(SHA-256(SPKI)),\n  key at {DataDir}/oauth-signing.pem mode 600) so the addon can verify them offline. The\n  desktop stays the only auth server, so GetJwks goes over the authenticated gRPC channel\n  and no key ever reaches an addon that cannot reach the desktop.\n- Collapse the access-token TTL to OAuth.AddonToken.AccessTokenTtlSeconds (900). It was\n  hardcoded in 6 places, so exp and expires_in could disagree and the addon would wait a\n  further 45 minutes before refreshing, failing every request in that window. The\n  client_credentials machine token keeps its own TTL.\n- Add OAuthRefreshToken.UserId plus a ref-counted per-session lock with a re-read inside\n  it: two concurrent refreshes otherwise rotate the same token twice, which the desktop\n  reads as theft and answers by revoking the entire chain.\n- Make the availability gate fail-closed. IsConnected is now _streamUp, opened only by the\n  desktop''s handshake message and closed whenever the receive loop ends, including a clean\n  stream close; keepalive pings surface an unclean desktop death within seconds instead of\n  leaving the gate open forever. Note the semantic change for addon consumers.\n- Classify refresh failures by the nmx-error-code trailer: unauthenticated is overloaded on\n  this channel, so only invalid_grant and theft_detected end the session. A desktop restart,\n  a channel that has not started, or a timeout now returns 503 and keeps the session rather\n  than logging the user out over a recoverable failure.\n- Widen OAuthToken.TokenId to 1024 for the ~630-char token. SQLite maps every MaxLength to\n  TEXT, so WidenOAuthTokenId is empty by design — it exists only to advance the snapshot;\n  AddOAuthRefreshTokenUserId does add a real column and needs a db update.","tree":{"sha":"348e3b828a01b77560194bcc3476b25d7083253d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/trees/348e3b828a01b77560194bcc3476b25d7083253d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/commits/f5050e60265ce1e0f5e091bf46f507db8f0beafe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"h