18cdb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T03:56:32Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T03:56:32Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"message":"fix(backend): build addon OAuth redirect_uri from forwarded headers\n\nYARP suppresses the incoming Host header, so an addon behind the desktop''s\nfrontgate saw its internal address and produced a redirect_uri pointing at the\ninternal IP — after OAuth the browser was sent there instead of the domain.\nDerive scheme/host from X-Forwarded-Proto/X-Forwarded-Host, falling back to\nRequest.Scheme/Request.Host.","tree":{"sha":"648fd5d8577350433f0401e40c1e23bede44ade4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/trees/648fd5d8577350433f0401e40c1e23bede44ade4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/commits/8ca37ae71b3dd6ba5636d37a72cac48b83018cdb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17359499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IzeroCs","id":17359499,"login":"IzeroCs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzU5NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Namorix/namorix/commit/8ca37ae71b3dd6ba5636d37a72cac48b83018cdb","node_id":"C_kwDORssok9oAKDhjYTM3YWU3MWIzZGQ2YmE1NjM2ZDM3YTcyY2FjNDhiODMwMThjZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Namorix/namorix/commit/7b71c11b2306e0f46a1740bc49d0f932bd5a75ab","sha":"7b71c11b2306e0f46a1740bc49d0f932bd5a75ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/7b71c11b2306e0f46a1740bc49d0f932bd5a75ab"}],"sha":"8ca37ae71b3dd6ba5636d37a72cac48b83018cdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/8ca37ae71b3dd6ba5636d37a72cac48b83018cdb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17359499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IzeroCs","id":17359499,"login":"IzeroCs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzU5NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/commits/7b71c11b2306e0f46a1740bc49d0f932bd5a75ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T03:56:32Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T03:56:32Z","email":"izero.cs@gmail.com","name":"Nguyen Danh Nam"},"message":"fix(backend): stop desktop static files shadowing proxied addons\n\n- Program.cs: proxy-port UseStaticFiles ran before MapReverseProxy and was\n  host-blind, so any file present in the desktop build (mf-entry-bootstrap-0.js,\n  assets/hostInit-*.js) was returned for every host — scout.<domain> loaded the\n  desktop''s bootstrap and assets. Serve them only for hosts without a frontgate\n  rule; rule hosts go through YARP to their own destination.\n- FrontgateProxyConfigProvider: expose DestinationSources (source host ->\n  host:port set of destination + locations).\n- RewriteRedirectLocationMiddleware: rewrite Location only when it targets the\n  rule''s own upstream (loopback aliases included); pass cross-host redirects\n  (e.g. an OAuth redirect_uri) through untouched, and only override scheme when\n  X-Forwarded-Proto is present.","tree":{"sha":"0478d3238e3326307d6890bf802107fa28417637","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/trees/0478d3238e3326307d6890bf802107fa28417637"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Namorix/namorix/git/commits/7b71c11b2306e0f46a1740bc49d0f932bd5a75ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17359499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IzeroCs","id":17359499,"login":"IzeroCs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzU5NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzeroCs","user_view_type":"public"},"htm