id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/cd5ee4a856026bb185ad03a57c66d6d9f189ca57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T13:36:44Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T13:36:44Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: green CI — complete logger test config + satisfy strictTypeChecked lint\n\nBuild (tsc) and Lint run after Test in CI; the prior green-test run surfaced:\n- tests/unit/logger.test.ts makeConfig() built a CoderConfig literal missing the\n  fields added this session (default_adaptor/episodes_dir/graph_dir/capture_prompts)\n  → TS2322. Add them.\n- strictTypeChecked bans non-null assertions and a&&a.b truthy chains:\n  - recorder.test.ts: replace ep!.id with a null-guarded reload.\n  - recorder.ts: ex.threads && ex.threads.length → ex.threads !== undefined && …\n  - server.ts: ctx.recorder && … → ctx.recorder !== undefined && … (consistency).\n\nRefs #60\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01YXSXnrQYgLtvccTgpsutiu","tree":{"sha":"beed3b204afb9d905fbd19d2a8edaa0868546453","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/trees/beed3b204afb9d905fbd19d2a8edaa0868546453"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/commits/cd5ee4a856026bb185ad03a57c66d6d9f189ca57","verification":{"payload":"tree beed3b204afb9d905fbd19d2a8edaa0868546453\nparent a150ac3e24f201de5fc06eb60d2ef8477a7bc4e4\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781185004 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@ant