rl":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/db1ae44baba611fca869087c909673e870e452a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T14:58:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T14:58:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: unify SSD self-improvement onto serve branch + prompt-layer persona traits\n\nReconcile the diverged recursive-self-improvement work onto the serve-based\nline by porting the self-distillation (SSD) pipeline additively (keeping\n`coder serve`; the UI mascot subsystem is intentionally not pulled), then wire\nthe think -> capture -> train loop and a first prompt-layer persona dial.\n\nPort (additive):\n- prompt-log capture (capturePrompt/loadSamplePrompts), sampler.sampleCompletions\n- adaptor self-improve SSD orchestrator + `coder adaptor self-improve`\n- `coder data prompts` (list/stats/deduplicate/purge)\n- config union: add default_adaptor + capture_prompts, keep port\n- GenerateOptions temperature/topP -> mlx --temp/--top-p\n- TrainingDivergedError + loss-spike abort in runMlxTrain\n- self_improve_* log events; resetLoggerForTest\n- capture wiring in generate/chat (opt-in, never in dry-run)\n\nServe capture (think -> capture link):\n- ServeContext gains capturePrompts + adaptorPackDir; /generate records the\n  user prompt to <adaptor>/data/prompt-log.jsonl once a generation completes\n- serve command resolves adaptor via default_adaptor and passes capture config\n\nPersona traits (prompt-layer v1, the TARS dial):\n- src/persona/traits.ts: formality/sarcasm/verbosity (1-7), parseTraitCommand,\n  resolveTraits, applyTraits\n- /generate accepts a `traits` object folded into the system prompt at request\n  time (no retrain). Adapter-layer traits deferred (one adaptor per session).\n\nTests: port self-improve/sampler/data-prompts/generate-capture + mlx/training\ndeltas; add persona-traits, config (default_adaptor/capture_prompts), and serve\ncapture + resolveRequestSystem tests. Docs: proposal + CLAUDE.md/spec updates.\n\nNote: gates (tsc/eslint/bun test) could not run in the web sandbox (npm\nregistry blocked, no `bun install`); changes transpile-checked + contract-\nverified manually. CI must confirm.\n\nRefs #60\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01YXSXnrQYgLtvccTgpsutiu","tree":{"sha":"b38fef5c95b861aea05d9fa89f1da7d2e2ebf9be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/trees/b38fef5c95b861aea05d9fa89f1da7d2e2ebf9be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/commits/db1ae44baba611fca869087c909673e870e452a9","verification":{"payload":"tree b38fef5c95b861aea05d9fa89f1da7d2e2ebf9be\nparent 33c495fb8d838d995989a0ec408b9e51f39b968b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780844336 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780844336 +0000\n\nfeat: unify SSD self-improvement onto serve branch + prompt-layer persona traits\n\nReconcile the diverged recursive-self-improvement work onto the serve-based\nline by porting the self-distillation (SSD) pipeline additively (keeping\n`coder serve`; the UI mascot subsystem is intentionally not pulled), then wire\nthe think -> capture -> train loop and a first prompt-layer persona dial.\n\nPort (additive):\n- prompt-log capture (capturePrompt/loadSamplePrompts), sampler.sampleCompletions\n- adaptor self-improve SSD orchestrator + `coder adaptor self-improve`\n- `coder data prompts` (list/stats/deduplicate/purge)\n- config union: add default_adaptor + capture_prompts, keep port\n- GenerateOptions temperature/topP -> mlx --temp/--top-p\n- TrainingDivergedError + loss-spike abort in runMlxTrain\n- self_improve_* log events; resetLoggerForTest\n- capture wiring in generate/chat (opt-in, never in dry-run)\n\nServe capture (think -> capture link):\n- ServeContext gains capturePrompts + adaptorPackDir; /generate records the\n  user prompt to <adaptor>/data/prompt-log.jsonl once a generation completes\n- serve command resolves adaptor via default_adaptor and passes capture config\n\nPersona traits (prompt-layer v1, the TARS dial):\n- src/persona/traits.ts: formality/sarcasm/verbosity (1-7), parseTraitCommand,\n  resolveTraits, applyTraits\n- /generate accepts a `traits` object folded into the system prompt at request\n  time (no retrain). Adapter-layer traits deferred (one adaptor per session).\n\nTests: port self-improve/sampler/data-prompts/generate-capture + mlx/training\ndeltas; add persona-traits, config (default_adaptor/capture_prompts), and serve\ncapture + resolveRequestSystem tests. Docs: proposal + CLAUDE.md/spec updates.\n\nNote: gates (tsc/eslint/bun test) could not run in the web sandbox (npm\nregistry blocked, no `bun install`); changes transpile-checked + contract-\nverified manually. CI must confirm.\n\nRefs #60\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01YXSXnrQYgLtvccTgpsutiu\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQE/5mwtY\nfts0R1otytJAivo/yVdEwScwe/LFv2tmVAgnvKhh5uW4Zk/idF4nBp7dkz/hdV6RK3ekKSKnvToY\n9Ao=\n-----EN