7cd","sha":"5606153fd4d49f92e6b164d77aba902bb21537cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/5606153fd4d49f92e6b164d77aba902bb21537cd"}],"sha":"33c495fb8d838d995989a0ec408b9e51f39b968b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/33c495fb8d838d995989a0ec408b9e51f39b968b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/5606153fd4d49f92e6b164d77aba902bb21537cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T03:37:33Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T03:37:33Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(serve): use a Map for channel lookup so undefined is preserved\n\nThe previous annotation didn''t help: TypeScript narrows a variable to its\ninitializer''s type, so KNOWN_CHANNELS[...] (Record, non-undefined) kept the\ntruthiness checks \"always truthy\" for eslint. Map.get() returns `… | undefined`\nand is not value-narrowed, so `if (mapped)` / `mapped && …` are genuine.\n\nRefs #58","tree":{"sha":"8024d1b03aba654198eb4c7b07e78eba01157eb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/trees/8024d1b03aba654198eb4c7b07e78eba01157eb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/commits/5606153fd4d49f92e6b164d77aba902bb21537cd","verification":{"payload":"tree 8024d1b03aba654198eb4c7b07e78eba01157eb8\nparent 60190739af42bc85b84e3c6432b7890af363718c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780803453 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780803453 +0000\n\nfix(serve): use a Map for channel lookup so undefined is preserved\n\nThe previous annotation didn''t help: TypeScript narrows a variable to its\ninitializer''s type, so KNOWN_CHANNELS[...] (Record, non-undefined) kept the\ntruthiness checks \"always truthy\" for eslint. Map.get() returns `… | undefined`\nand is not value-narrowed, so `if (mapped)` / `mapped && …` are genuine.\n\nRefs #58\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJzUgeGs\n5JMen739JQTbygIkWQeoIusjibn+OwpBMoZpmud3UUQBNnpj2di+5ofTibfvszLzhV/WBtMtWeio\nNAI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T03:37:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/coder/commit/5606153fd4d49f92e6b164d77aba902bb21537cd","node_id":"C_kwDORtCmEtoAKDU2MDYxNTNmZDRkNDlmOTJlNmIxNjRkNzdhYmE5MDJiYjIxNTM3Y2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/coder/commit/60190739af42bc85b84e3c6432b7890af363718c","sha":"60190739af42bc85b84e3c6432b7890af363718c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/60190739af42bc85b84e3c6432b7890af363718c"}],"sha":"5606153fd4d49f92e6b164d77aba902bb21537cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/5606153fd4d49f92e6b164d77aba902bb21537cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/60190739af42bc85b84e3c6432b7890af363718c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T03:35:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T03:35:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(serve): annotate channel lookup as optional to satisfy no-unnecessary-condition\n\nKNOWN_CHANNELS[...] is typed \"thought\" | \"final\" without noUncheckedIndexedAccess,\nso eslint flagged the (real) runtime-undefined truthiness checks as unnecessary.\nAnnotate the lookup result as possibly undefined.\n\nRefs #58","tree":{"sha":"e7b58688eb2cd36b4895b9a42944470dc090e8c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/trees/e7b58688eb2cd36b4895b9a42944470dc090e8c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/commits/60190739af42bc85b84e3c6432b7890af363718c","verification":{"payload":"tree e7b58688eb2cd36b4895b9a42944470dc090e8c4\nparent e353e2ca7e89bab658297bc7857e359a23e6741e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780803354 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780803354 +0000\n\nfix(serve): annotate channel lookup as optional to satisfy no-unnecessary-condition\n\nKNOWN_CHANNELS[...] is typed \"thought\" | \"final\" without noUncheckedIndexedAccess,\nso eslint flagged the (real) runtime-undefined truthiness checks as unnecessary.\nAnnotate the lookup result as possibly undefined.\n\nRefs #58\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQL+1WypC\nNbZvFhyGPXs52s0ER14wdZ3v8wjAbvWcwAbsUzjsCSregqEZ0ptTQjKONm4jcdJpdTmf7/jTaE2J\nwAI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T03:35:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/coder/commit/60190739af42bc85b84e3c6432b7890af363718c","node_id":"C_kwDORtCmEtoAKDYwMTkwNzM5YWY0MmJjODViODRlM2M2NDMyYjc4OTBhZjM2MzcxOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/coder/commit/e353e2ca7e89bab658297bc7857e359a23e6741e","sha":"e353e2ca7e89bab658297bc7857e359a23e6741e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/e353e2ca7e89bab658297bc7857e359a23e6741e"}],"sha":"60190739af42bc85b84e3c6432b7890af363718c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/60190739af42bc85b84e3c6432b7890af363718c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/e353e2ca7e89bab658297bc7857e359a23e6741e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T03:34:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T03:34:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(serve): tolerate malformed Harmony channel markers; never hide the answer\n\nSome models (e.g. gemma) emit pipe-variant channel markers like \"<channel|>\"\n(missing the leading pipe) to switch from analysis to the answer. The parser\nonly matched \"<|channel|>\"/\"<|channel>\", so the final answer stayed in the\nthought channel and rendered as reasoning in the UI.\n\n- Match channel/message markers across pipe variants (<channel|>, <|channel>, …)\n- A channel switch with no recognised name now defaults to \"final\", so an\n  answer is never hidden in the thought voice\n\nRefs #58","tree":{"sha":"44a1cb20b1c48a9f90571ab122513dc36cfc693f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/trees/44a1cb20b1c48a9f90571ab122513dc36cfc693f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/commits/e353e2ca7e89bab658297bc7857e359a23e6741e","verification":{"payload":"tree 44a1cb20b1c48a9f90571ab122513dc36cfc693f\nparent 077a35b3cfe77ddce040e9b08d76b64d50c23fc6\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780803257 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780803257 +0000\n\nfix(serve): tolerate malformed Harmony channel markers; never hide the answer\n\nSome models (e.g. gemma) emit pipe-variant channel markers like \"<channel|>\"\n(missing the leading pipe) to switch from analysis to the answer. The parser\nonly matched \"<|channel|>\"/\"<|channel>\", so the final answer stayed in the\nthought channel and rendered as reasoning in the UI.\n\n- Match channel/message markers across pipe variants (<channel|>, <|channel>, …)\n- A channel switch with no recognised name now defaults to \"final\", so an\n  answer is never hidden in the thought voice\n\nRefs #58\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBYjuMM2\n6EQhzmxBo/VtNRkxoSTUIBb7PS/Jg8gzdPxVipOIyGib+cmARjngrcakcLVW8XER/8SGZ7r9Sf6x\n8gE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T03:34:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/coder/commit/e353e2ca7e89bab658297bc7857e359a23e6741e","node_id":"C_kwDORtCmEtoAKGUzNTNlMmNhN2U4OWJhYjY1ODI5N2JjNzg1N2UzNTlhMjNlNjc0MWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/coder/commit/077a35b3cfe77ddce040e9b08d76b64d50c23fc6","sha":"077a35b3cfe77ddce040e9b08d76b64d50c23fc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/077a35b3cfe77ddce040e9b08d76b64d50c23fc6"}],"sha":"e353e2ca7e89bab658297bc7857e359a23e6741e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/e353e2ca7e89bab658297bc7857e359a23e6741e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/077a35b3cfe77ddce040e9b08d76b64d50c23fc6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T03:21:42Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T03:21:42Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(serve): channel-aware SSE — stream reasoning (thought) + final separately\n\nReasoning models (DeepSeek <think>…</think>, Harmony <|channel|>analysis/final)\nemit a chain-of-thought that previously leaked into the answer. Split it:\n\n- stripFraming(): mlx banner/echo/stats removal only (no token stripping)\n- parseChannels(): split text into { thought, final }, consuming structural\n  markers and dropping other special tokens; plain text is all \"final\" so\n  instruct models are unaffected (backward compatible)\n- /generate token events now carry a `channel: \"thought\" | \"final\"` field;\n  both voices stream with a tail holdback so partial markers never leak\n\nEnables the inner-voice \"meld the voices\" UI to render the model''s thinking as\na second inner voice alongside the user''s. <threads> blocks are preserved.\n\nRefs #58","tree":{"sha":"a4bb7d3b041967f506a8a5242d6b73365e0829d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/trees/a4bb7d3b041967f506a8a5242d6b73365e0829d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/commits/077a35b3cfe77ddce040e9b08d76b64d50c23fc6","verification":{"payload":"tree a4bb7d3b041967f506a8a5242d6b73365e0829d1\nparent 3560c7ec9c293b7753c27b7ac2b8a7b99819506f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780802502 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780802502 +0000\n\nfeat(serve): channel-aware SSE — stream reasoning (thought) + final separately\n\nReasoning models (DeepSeek <think>…</think>, Harmony <|channel|>analysis/final)\nemit a chain-of-thought that previously leaked into the answer. Split it:\n\n- stripFraming(): mlx banner/echo/stats removal only (no token stripping)\n- parseChannels(): split text into { thought, final }, consuming structural\n  markers and dropping other special tokens; plain text is all \"final\" so\n  instruct models are unaffected (backward compatible)\n- /generate token events now carry a `channel: \"thought\" | \"final\"` field;\n  both voices stream with a tail holdback so partial markers never leak\n\nEnables the inner-voice \"meld the voices\" UI to render the model''s thinking as\na second inner voice alongside the user''s. <threads> blocks are preserved.\n\nRefs #58\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJuS+YQX\nZSydwboFWYqOAekUS2/OOVtZ8EQXEnf3DmF4H80Sp1+HjjfM92GtcxPw6KAB8LCGRPitLboHd+dd\nqQ8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T03:21:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/coder/commit/077a35b3cfe77ddce040e9b08d76b64d50c23fc6","node_id":"C_kwDORtCmEtoAKDA3N2EzNWIzY2ZlNzdkZGNlMDQwZTliMDhkNzZiNjRkNTBjMjNmYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/coder/commit/3560c7ec9c293b7753c27b7ac2b8a7b99819506f","sha":"3560c7ec9c293b7753c27b7ac2b8a7b99819506f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/3560c7ec9c293b7753c27b7ac2b8a7b99819506f"}],"sha":"077a35b3cfe77ddce040e9b08d76b64d50c23fc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/077a35b3cfe77ddce040e9b08d76b64d50c23fc6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/3560c7ec9c293b7753c27b7ac2b8a7b99819506f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T03:07:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T03:07:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(serve): disable Bun''s 10s idle timeout for streaming generations\n\nBun.serve defaults to a 10s idleTimeout. During the first request the mlx_lm\nsubprocess loads the model with no socket bytes for longer than that, so Bun\naborted the connection before the first token (\"request timed out after 10\nseconds\"). Set idleTimeout: 0 — appropriate for a long-running local SSE\ninference endpoint.\n\nRefs #58","tree":{"sha":"976017c1aae099127a73e382f1c991ed8db3232b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/trees/976017c1aae099127a73e382f1c991ed8db3232b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/commits/3560c7ec9c293b7753c27b7ac2b8a7b99819506f","verification":{"payload":"tree 976017c1aae099127a73e382f1c991ed8db3232b\nparent 479fcdef2cbd2932a8219fb40b31132bf3d50d48\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780801676 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780801676 +0000\n\nfix(serve): disable Bun''s 10s idle timeout for streaming generations\n\nBun.serve defaults to a 10s idleTimeout. During the first request the mlx_lm\nsubprocess loads the model with no socket bytes for longer than that, so Bun\naborted the connection before the first token (\"request timed out after 10\nseconds\"). Set idleTimeout: 0 — appropriate for a long-running local SSE\ninference endpoint.\n\nRefs #58\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQH3lx7Ia\naGAxFcFZTcKVI+EsM9oQZL0vUv0Nqgr7cGs4s/DDaptnBKJv1JdH9WUppR2TyhOF0biI/qJsrg9J\ncwM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T03:07:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/coder/commit/3560c7ec9c293b7753c27b7ac2b8a7b99819506f","node_id":"C_kwDORtCmEtoAKDM1NjBjN2VjOWMyOTNiNzc1M2MyN2I3YWMyYjhhN2I5OTgxOTUwNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/coder/commit/479fcdef2cbd2932a8219fb40b31132bf3d50d48","sha":"479fcdef2cbd2932a8219fb40b31132bf3d50d48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/479fcdef2cbd2932a8219fb40b31132bf3d50d48"}],"sha":"3560c7ec9c293b7753c27b7ac2b8a7b99819506f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/3560c7ec9c293b7753c27b7ac2b8a7b99819506f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/479fcdef2cbd2932a8219fb40b31132bf3d50d48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T02:56:42Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T02:56:42Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(serve): strip mlx_lm framing/stats/special tokens from SSE tokens\n\nThe /generate stream forwarded runMlxStream''s raw stdout verbatim, so SSE\ntoken events leaked the \"==========\" banners, the trailing\n\"Prompt:/Generation:/Peak memory\" stats block, and chat-template special\ntokens (e.g. <|im_end|>) into consumers (visible in the inner-voice UI).\n\nAdd cleanMlxText (pure, total) to extract just the generated text, and emit\ncleaned deltas from the stream with a small holdback so a partial closing\nbanner is never sent mid-stream; the remainder is flushed at end. <threads>\nblocks are preserved (no pipe — not a special token) for the client to parse.\n\nRefs #58","tree":{"sha":"27e0c74c1bba17ad0d2fb0e5d7d5c7bc1a00e1f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/trees/27e0c74c1bba17ad0d2fb0e5d7d5c7bc1a00e1f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/commits/479fcdef2cbd2932a8219fb40b31132bf3d50d48","verification":{"payload":"tree 27e0c74c1bba17ad0d2fb0e5d7d5c7bc1a00e1f9\nparent 0e17255d93532802bf60689a910f4334ecf3c24e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780801002 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780801002 +0000\n\nfix(serve): strip mlx_lm framing/stats/special tokens from SSE tokens\n\nThe /generate stream forwarded runMlxStream''s raw stdout verbatim, so SSE\ntoken events leaked the \"==========\" banners, the trailing\n\"Prompt:/Generation:/Peak memory\" stats block, and chat-template special\ntokens (e.g. <|im_end|>) into consumers (visible in the inner-voice UI).\n\nAdd cleanMlxText (pure, total) to extract just the generated text, and emit\ncleaned deltas from the stream with a small holdback so a partial closing\nbanner is never sent mid-stream; the remainder is flushed at end. <threads>\nblocks are preserved (no pipe — not a special token) for the client to parse.\n\nRefs #58\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLImPTK3\nFRNctjyJV7zMKsxhvAcXyFP8P3jmBCvadaeX5Z7P6V1CUfzEN/S4JZfGAwcm2u9M2wldc1Pu5TQk\niQ8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T02:56:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"ht