aced in CI (bun-types installed):\n- src/serve/start.ts: Bun types Server.port as `number | undefined`; fall\n  back to the requested port so RunningServer.port stays `number`.\n- tests/unit/logger.test.ts: makeConfig built a CoderConfig literal without\n  the new required `port` field — add it.\n\nRefs #58","tree":{"sha":"865b493d5914ee6f2d0f5401f51b2a830b6dba44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/trees/865b493d5914ee6f2d0f5401f51b2a830b6dba44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/commits/7ec4af23a8e6f46fe4f571a8de6407bf64293d88","verification":{"payload":"tree 865b493d5914ee6f2d0f5401f51b2a830b6dba44\nparent 05a097efbd591c98dc1b4e8bdb57ecc79f2d5fbf\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780765150 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780765150 +0000\n\nfix(serve): typecheck — narrow Bun server.port and add port to test config\n\nTwo tsc --noEmit errors surfaced in CI (bun-types installed):\n- src/serve/start.ts: Bun types Server.port as `number | undefined`; fall\n  back to the requested port so RunningServer.port stays `number`.\n- tests/unit/logger.test.ts: makeConfig built a CoderConfig literal without\n  the new required `port` field — add it.\n\nRefs #58\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQO0Pz/Wb\nP0jCo7Yqt84K6TFwYfF3seaG+3xd+ENXiFPK5jjGvEqHgLcgHY49ZS4LU6Zn+b2xIuj1/2b1lhDb\nngc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-06T16:59:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"htt