type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/05a097efbd591c98dc1b4e8bdb57ecc79f2d5fbf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T16:20:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T16:20:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(serve): add `coder serve` local SSE inference endpoint\n\nExpose the existing runMlxStream subprocess layer over HTTP via Bun.serve\nso the inner-voice MFE (and other local agentic clients) can stream tokens.\n\n- GET  /health   -> {\"status\":\"ok\",\"model\":\"<path>\"}\n- POST /generate -> text/event-stream SSE (token / done / error events)\n- CORS: Access-Control-Allow-Origin: * + OPTIONS preflight (local dev tool)\n- handleRequest is pure over ServeContext (no fs/config) for unit testing\n- Reuses runMlxStream; checkMemory gate runs before binding (fail fast)\n- Adds `port` to config schema (default 3991); model from --model or config\n- Logs server_start via the structured logger\n\nTests: dep-free unit tests cover the full HTTP/SSE surface (handler +\nreal Bun.serve boot); integration test spawns the CLI end to end.\n\nRefs #coder-serve","tree":{"sha":"d363a96843983e0f35e39ea1044eba50e9d11aac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/trees/d363a96843983e0f35e39ea1044eba50e9d11aac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/commits/05a097efbd591c98dc1b4e8bdb57ecc79f2d5fbf","verification":{"payload":"tree d363a96843983e0f35e39ea1044eba50e9d11aac\nparent 0efe7acdf1297772769d9529c1756993cb0a4ce5\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780762824 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780762824 +0000\n\nfeat(serve): add `coder serve` local SSE inference endpoint\n\nExpose the existing runMlxStream subprocess layer over HTTP via Bun.serve\nso the inner-voice MFE (and other local agentic clients) can stream tokens.\n\n- GET  /health   -> {\"status\":\"ok\",\"model\":\"<path>\"}\n- POST /generate -> text/event-stream SSE (token / done / error events)\n- CORS: Access-Control-Allow-Origin: * + OPTIONS preflight (local dev tool)\n- handleRequest is pure over ServeContext (no fs/config) for unit testing\n- Reuses runMlxStream; checkMemory gate runs before binding (fail fast)\n- Adds `port` to config schema (default 3991); model from --model or config\n- Logs server_start via the structured logger\n\nTests: dep-free unit tests cover the full HTTP/SSE surface (handler +\nreal Bun.serve boot); integration test spawns the CLI end to end.\n\nRefs #coder-serve\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLCVMWej\n8VaM1N71RpFjYGQEjakjDwBqVTcttnwC27h/PUb/DuLGlZ4gaBQw9pKjYz2GfZj7LMpB2KqKzsfw\nygo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-06T16:20:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/coder/commit/05a097efbd591c98dc1b4e8bdb57ecc79f2d5fbf","node_id":"C_kwDORtCmEtoAKDA1