inConfig, generateLoraYaml\n- src/training/runner.ts: spawn mlx_lm.lora, loss line streaming, checkpoint resumption, manifest version bump\n- training_step + training_complete observability events\n\n#9 — coder adaptor eval <name> [--baseline] [--input <file>]\n- src/eval/runner.ts: tsc/eslint/bun-test scorers (weights 0.4/0.3/0.3), composite score, table output, manifest update\n- --baseline writes baseline_pass_rate; normal eval writes eval_pass_rate\n- eval_complete observability event\n- CODER_DRY_RUN=1 supported throughout\n\n271 tests, tsc clean, eslint clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45321c0cc01b4ecad379c51a2ed901f0a47c82c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/trees/45321c0cc01b4ecad379c51a2ed901f0a47c82c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/commits/337ab90a3fbdd5d9a66436268d066fe631530893","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9287957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/falese","id":9287957,"login":"falese","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODc5NTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/coder/commit/337ab90a3fbdd5d9a66436268d066fe631530893","node_id":"C_kwDORtCmEtoAKDMzN2FiOTBhM2ZiZGQ1ZDlhNjY0MzYyNjhkMDY2ZmU2MzE1MzA4OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/coder/commit/13ef64adcb0ee8089c6e67dd64a47e440ced82ee","sha":"13ef64adcb0ee8089c6e67dd64a47e440ced82ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/13ef64adcb0ee8089c6e67dd64a47e440ced82ee"}],"sha":"337ab90a3fbdd5d9a66436268d066fe631530893","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/337ab90a3fbdd5d9a66436268d066fe631530893"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9287957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/falese","id":9287957,"login":"falese","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODc5NTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/13ef64adcb0ee8089c6e67dd64a47e440ced82ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T01:54:44Z","email":"falese@gmail.com","name":"Sean Falese"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T01:54:44Z","email":"falese@gmail.com","name":"Sean Falese"},"message":"feat(#2,#4,#6,#7,#10,#13,#15,#17): phases 2–4 — streaming, chat, adaptors, data pipeline, CI\n\nImplements all outstanding work since the walking skeleton:\n\nPhase 2 — Core UX:\n- #2/#10 generate: --stream (TTFT measured spawn→first chunk), -o, --context, --system, --adaptor flags; structured JSON observability (generation_start/complete events, ttft_ms, tok_s)\n- #4 chat: interactive multi-turn REPL (for await readline), ChatML history, sliding window 6 000 tokens, /clear /save /exit, Ctrl-C cancel\n- #6 adaptor: install (--from-git), list, update, info, remove; Zod manifest validation\n\nPhase 3 — Infrastructure:\n- #13 CI: .github/workflows/ci.yml on macos-latest (checkout, setup-bun, cache, test, build, lint)\n- #15 memory gate: checkMemory(diskBytes, adaptorBytes); refuse >18 GB, warn <2 GB; CODER_DRY_RUN bypass\n- #17 preflight: python3 + mlx_lm check cached per process\n\nPhase 4 — Data pipeline:\n- #7 data ingest/extract/deduplicate/validate/split/stats\n  - ingest: glob walk, binary detection, 100 KB limit\n  - extract: jsdoc/line_comment anchors → next_function/next_block completions via extract.json rules\n  - deduplicate: exact dedup + Jaccard trigram near-dedup (threshold 0.85)\n  - validate: non-empty fields, ≤2048 token gate (chars/4)\n  - split: seeded Fisher-Yates (seed 42), 90/10 default, .train.jsonl + .valid.jsonl\n  - stats: count, mean/p50/p95 token lengths, duplicate rate\n\n213 tests (23 files), tsc clean, ESLint clean.\ndocs/data-pipeline.md: source repo setup guide, annotation conventions, quality targets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb3312ac3adb2f2cd8e3e1737439ba8771bae940","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/trees/bb3312ac3adb2f2cd8e3e1737439ba8771bae940"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/commits/13ef64adcb0ee8089c6e67dd64a47e440ced82ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9287957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/us