epo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/commits/f96b0d8a62449d0eea67707936a52aa8a253993f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T00:32:09Z","email":"falese@gmail.com","name":"Sean Falese"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T00:32:09Z","email":"falese@gmail.com","name":"Sean Falese"},"message":"feat: add logging functionality and memory safety checks\n\n- Introduced a logging system to capture events and errors, including generation start and completion.\n- Added a new command to stream logs to stdout.\n- Implemented memory checks to prevent exceeding system limits when loading models and adaptors.\n- Enhanced the generate command with new options for streaming output, context files, and system prompts.\n- Updated configuration to include a logs directory and log level settings.\n- Refactored the MLX runner to support buffered and streaming output modes.\n- Added tests for logging, memory checks, and the new generate command features.","tree":{"sha":"a75d7cdd0a3301e9c9640c976b54838481626dcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/trees/a75d7cdd0a3301e9c9640c976b54838481626dcb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/coder/git/commits/f96b0d8a62449d0eea67707936a52aa8a253993f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9287957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/falese/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/falese","id":9287957,"login":"falese","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODc5NTc=","org