"email":"bernhardtdt@travelit.co.za","name":"Bernhardt du Toit"},"message":"Minimal reproduction: getPackageNamedExports fails for ESM-only shared packages\n\nDemonstrates that @module-federation/vite v1.13.2 cannot discover named\nexports from ESM-only packages (no ''require'' condition in package.json\nexports) when building with Vite 8 / Rolldown.\n\nBuild fails with MISSING_EXPORT because the generated __loadShare__ wrapper\nfalls back to ''export *'' which Rolldown cannot statically resolve through\nthe async virtual module chain.","tree":{"sha":"80d12cc3ee25b8f213aef6511b1581c20bc8a585","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BernhardtDT/mf-vite-esm-bug/git/trees/80d12cc3ee25b8f213aef6511b1581c20bc8a585"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BernhardtDT/mf-vite-esm-bug/git/commits/cba519aed09e595563be1dc3496a32a21c022443","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/327898577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bernhardtdt1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bernhardtdt1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bernhardtdt1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bernhardtdt1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bernhardtdt1","id":327898577,"login":"bernhardtdt1","node_id":"U_kgDOE4tV0Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bernhardtdt1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bernhardtdt1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bernhardtdt1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bernhardtdt1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bernhardtdt1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bernhardtdt1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/BernhardtDT/mf-vite-esm-bug/commit/cba51