each portal)\n- Review queue: expandable cards with customer snapshot, COMPASS action plan,\n  triggered signals; reject requires reason; labels clarify approve→RM /\n  reject→de-escalate outcome\n- RM Today: shows manager-approved escalations as action items and\n  de-escalated ones as stand-down notices\n- Pipeline: SSE direct to port 8000 (bypass Next.js proxy buffering)\n- Audit: PDF export via window.print(); LLM spinner with model timing hint\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ee129679db6bb82e0d03508a3063489c8ded82a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/trees/6ee129679db6bb82e0d03508a3063489c8ded82a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/commits/03167fc148d391f2fbc00bc90625290e0f27897d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213081241?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atrijopal","id":213081241,"login":"atrijopal","node_id":"U_kgDODLNcmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commit/03167fc148d391f2fbc00bc90625290e0f27897d",