 with live Kafka ticker, model health, attention rail, KPI strip\n- /admin/architecture: Interactive 7-layer SVG diagram with animated data packets and health dots\n- /admin/graphsage: Force-directed peer graph with node attribution panel and model facts\n- /admin/approvals: HERALD human-in-loop approval queue with reject/approve + audit trail\n- /admin/pipeline: Live Kafka topic flow + per-layer health probes with real-time updates\n- /admin/relearning: ORACLE 4 learning cycles, retraining gate, channel policy table, DR uplift\n- Sidebar: Reorganized into 4 groups (Command, Operations, Models & AI, Compliance)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2f7aa3010dc70ded148fd122d04825822c59bc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/trees/f2f7aa3010dc70ded148fd122d04825822c59bc7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/commits/6c890c7b970f65d1c353a63b6c88f6add8619678","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213081241?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atrijopal","id":213081241,"login":"atrijopal","node_id":"U_kgDODLNcmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github