 createCustomer\n- Server: reviews stats/officers/action endpoints, POST /api/customers stub, SSE token-in-query-param auth\n- HERALD: rich customer-aware prompt (signals, life events, behavioural data) → NVIDIA DeepSeek V4 Pro\n- Switch from expired Azure AI key to NVIDIA API (integrate.api.nvidia.com)\n- Data: seed JSON files added (customers, scores, signals, herald, survival, action_plans, portfolio, transactions)","tree":{"sha":"c4bb7c9d54d5346d6d74b0e71f443d4e9b94fd53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/trees/c4bb7c9d54d5346d6d74b0e71f443d4e9b94fd53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/commits/193f17433c978816b4dc764a90dee9e004e4f6ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213081241?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atrijopal","id":213081241,"login":"atrijopal","node_id":"U_kgDODLNcmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commit/193f17433c978816b4dc764a90dee9e004e4f6ff","node_id":"C_kwDORtJIiNoAKDE5M2YxNzQzM2M5Nzg4MTZiNGRjNzY0YTkwZGVlOWUwMDRlNGY2ZmY","parents":