 (Chronos FastAPI, Postgres, Kafka, bank API) is skipped\n  because localData.js and pre-computed JSONs replace all of it\n\nThree deployment options documented:\n- Option A: Railway (recommended - no cold starts, $5/mo free credit, monorepo)\n- Option B: Vercel + Render (free, cold start warning for Render)\n- Option C: Fly.io (Docker-native, 3 free VMs)\n\nAlso includes env var reference, demo credentials, and troubleshooting guide\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1eaf1a95abba747737abccecfbb91595da8f1a19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/trees/1eaf1a95abba747737abccecfbb91595da8f1a19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/commits/7856be6bb7240c4853c17c5f40cfa35c6cf416ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213081241?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atrijopal","id":213081241,"login":"atrijopal","node_id":"U_kgDODLNcmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commit/7856be6bb7240c4853c17c5f40cfa35c6cf416ea","node_id":"C_kw