n- Prerequisites (Docker Desktop, Azure CLI)\n- Resource group + Container Registry setup\n- Backend image build from repo root (includes chronos/data)\n- Frontend image build with API_BACKEND_URL baked in\n- Container Apps deployment for both services\n- Environment variable reference table\n- Update/redeploy commands\n- Cost breakdown (~$9-15/month, ~13-22 months on $200)\n- Troubleshooting section + teardown\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"254685a81822cf63a275d617a6ca19fc8d9e253a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/trees/254685a81822cf63a275d617a6ca19fc8d9e253a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/commits/65db02cbec4ff5ce65d9f74d636390c511992af1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213081241?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atrijopal","id":213081241,"login":"atrijopal","node_id":"U_kgDODLNcmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commit/65db02cbec4ff5ce65d9f74d636390c511992af1","node_id":"C_kwDORtJIiNoAKDY1ZGIwMmNiZWM0ZmY1Y2U2NWQ5Zjc0ZDYzNjM5MGM1MTE5OTJhZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commit/a8cfb2611076d25626ecd597e0d1f043f6b6bb28","sha":"a8cfb2611076d25626ecd597e0d1f043f6b6bb28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commits/a8cfb2611076d25626ecd597e0d1f043f6b6bb28"}],"sha":"65db02cbec4ff5ce65d9f74d636390c511992af1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commits/65db02cbec4ff5ce65d9f74d636390c511992af1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213081241?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atrijopal","id":213081241,"login":"atrijopal","node_id":"U_kgDODLNcmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commits/a8cfb2611076d25626ecd597e0d1f043f6b6bb28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T19:50:50Z","email":"covalentradius80@gmail.com","name":"atrijopal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T19:50:50Z","email":"covalentradius80@gmail.com","name":"atrijopal"},"message":"fix: Docker build fixes for Azure Container Apps deployment\n\nserver/Dockerfile:\n- Build context is now repo root (not server/) so chronos/data can be bundled\n- COPY chronos/data → /app/chronos_data inside image\n- Set CHRONOS_DATA_DIR=/app/chronos_data env var\n\nserver/routes/v2.js:\n- DATA_DIR now reads CHRONOS_DATA_DIR env var first, falls back to\n  relative path for local dev\n\nclient/Dockerfile:\n- Replaced NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL build arg with API_BACKEND_URL\n  (aligns with next.config.ts rewrites() which uses API_BACKEND_URL)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd3f5cb9c76c5423d87a66cb42103196926232ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/trees/dd3f5cb9c76c5423d87a66cb42103196926232ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/commits/a8cfb2611076d25626ecd597e0d1f043f6b6bb28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213081241?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atrijopal","id":213081241,"login":"atrijopal","node_id":"U_kgDODLNcmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commit/a8cfb2611076d25626ecd597e0d1f043f6b6bb28","node_id":"C_kwDORtJIiNoAKGE4Y2ZiMjYxMTA3NmQyNTYyNmVjZDU5N2UwZDFmMDQzZjZiNmJiMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commit/48009ed0c0f95ab65e0306e0da216c03bc74b636","sha":"48009ed0c0f95ab65e0306e0da216c03bc74b636","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commits/48009ed0c0f95ab65e0306e0da216c03bc74b636"}],"sha":"a8cfb2611076d25626ecd597e0d1f043f6b6bb28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commits/a8cfb2611076d25626ecd597e0d1f043f6b6bb28"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213081241?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atrijopal","id":213081241,"login":"atrijopal","node_id":"U_kgDODLNcmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commits/48009ed0c0f95ab65e0306e0da216c03bc74b636/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T19:35:37Z","email":"covalentradius80@gmail.com","name":"atrijopal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T19:36:58Z","email":"covalentradius80@gmail.com","name":"atrijopal"},"message":"feat: landing page + layout routing + hardcoded URL fixes\n\nLanding page (app/page.tsx):\n- Full-page marketing site replacing the old router.push redirect\n- Instrument Serif italic headline, JetBrains Mono for metrics/credentials\n- Bloomberg Terminal aesthetic: #06090f dark, electric blue, amber gold\n- Dot-grid animated background, glowing stat counters (5 metrics ribbon)\n- 3-column How it Works, 7-layer architecture timeline\n- Terminal-style credential panel with click-to-copy for all 3 demo accounts\n- No sidebar/topbar on this page\n\nConditionalShell (components/ConditionalShell.tsx):\n- Client component that reads usePathname()\n- Renders sidebar+topbar only for authenticated routes\n- Public routes (/, /login) render children directly, full viewport\n\nHardcoded URL fixes:\n- useOutreachStream.ts: replaced absolute localhost:8000 with relative /api/\n- This completes the set with api.ts (done prior) and KafkaStreamCard (done prior)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"40b4aeeb8e03e42021da9a2c46200c3cd1ffdd1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/trees/40b4aeeb8e03e42021da9a2c46200c3cd1ffdd1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/commits/48009ed0c0f95ab65e0306e0da216c03bc74b636","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213081241?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atrijopal","id":213081241,"login":"atrijopal","node_id":"U_kgDODLNcmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commit/48009ed0c0f95ab65e0306e0da216c03bc74b636","node_id":"C_kwDORtJIiNoAKDQ4MDA5ZWQwYzBmOTVhYjY1ZTAzMDZlMGRhMjE2YzAzYmM3NGI2MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commit/7162670c249cede3cbddab9a5e57300e161e5c19","sha":"7162670c249cede3cbddab9a5e57300e161e5c19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commits/7162670c249cede3cbddab9a5e57300e161e5c19"}],"sha":"48009ed0c0f95ab65e0306e0da216c03bc74b636","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commits/48009ed0c0f95ab65e0306e0da216c03bc74b636"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213081241?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atrijopal","id":213081241,"login":"atrijopal","node_id":"U_kgDODLNcmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/commits/7162670c249cede3cbddab9a5e57300e161e5c19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T18:40:42Z","email":"covalentradius80@gmail.com","name":"atrijopal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T19:36:57Z","email":"covalentradius80@gmail.com","name":"atrijopal"},"message":"fix: resolve production refresh loop on Azure deployment\n\nThree root causes fixed:\n\n1. next.config.ts — Add API_BACKEND_URL rewrite proxy so all /api/* and\n   /auth/* calls are forwarded to the backend server-side. Eliminates\n   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL being baked in at build time and avoids\n   mixed-content (HTTP on HTTPS) blocks in Azure Container Apps.\n\n2. api.ts — Switch API_URL to relative '''' so browser calls go to same\n   origin (handled by Next.js rewrites). Fix 401 handler to check\n   window.location.pathname !== ''/login'' before redirecting — prevents\n   the hard-reload loop where 401 → redirect to /login → token gone\n   → API call → 401 → hard reload → repeat.\n\n3. KafkaStreamCard — Replace hardcoded http://localhost:8000 URLs with\n   relative /api/kafka/* paths. Add exponential backoff on SSE error\n   (3s → 30s cap) instead of fixed 5s reconnect, preventing rapid\n   connection cycling when the broker is unreachable.\n\nTo deploy: set API_BACKEND_URL=<backend-container-url> in the Azure\nContainer App environment variables for the frontend container.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b07bd909baa907fda156696f68c9416229fb8089","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/trees/b07bd909baa907fda156696f68c9416229fb8089"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/commits/7162670c249cede3cbddab9a5e57300e161e5c19","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213081241?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/followe