{"date":"2026-05-27T00:52:54Z","email":"covalentradius80@gmail.com","name":"atrijopal"},"message":"feat: PCOP platform — full-stack intelligence layer with Kafka pipeline\n\n- Kafka data pipeline (kafkaService.js) with live CBS event simulation\n  for 6 topics: transactions, accounts, CRM, signals, scores, engagement\n- Real-time score/signal updates flowing into dataStore from Kafka events\n- /api/kafka/status + /api/kafka/stream (SSE) + /api/kafka/publish routes\n- KafkaStreamCard component — live event feed on dashboard\n- Complete Analytics page rebuild: score distribution histogram,\n  risk tier donut, 30-day trend chart, ensemble attribution, signal-risk\n  correlation, life event impact, campaign uplift, channel effectiveness\n- Complete Signals page rebuild: CUSUM alarm feed with gauge bars,\n  customer risk grid, signal coverage heatmap, detection method breakdown\n- CompliancePanel: real KYC/channel eligibility/enrichment data\n- SurvivalPanel, CompassPanel, KnowledgeGraphCard: new components\n- Outreach SSE streaming via Azure DeepSeek with rich contextual prompt\n- localData.js: serves all 20 customers from bank/data JSON files\n- Naming overhaul: banking-oriented labels replacing ML jargon throughout\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f564347320c33c6e1738b6b827e307ccb9011313","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/trees/f564347320c33c6e1738b6b827e307ccb9011313"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KineticTactic/UnionBankIdeaHackathon/git/commits/041bb029f1a31730ebf0ae7f2b7f2c57153b29d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213081241?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atrijopal/following{/ot