ocal","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-25] Fix runtime issues and login error","tree":{"sha":"4a2ec5a028d2aa73ed0a38e0ec05a734995785df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/4a2ec5a028d2aa73ed0a38e0ec05a734995785df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/fadf5c6ef2f7d62a7a4097b3a31ad4ed3128b279","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/fadf5c6ef2f7d62a7a4097b3a31ad4ed3128b279","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKGZhZGY1YzZlZjJmN2Q2MmE3YTQwOTdiM2EzMWFkNGVkMzEyOGIyNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/617c01e4d60bcbb90b4d49bf8fb240e1485e46d7","sha":"617c01e4d60bcbb90b4d49bf8fb240e1485e46d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/617c01e4d60bcbb90b4d49bf8fb240e1485e46d7"}],"sha":"fadf5c6ef2f7d62a7a4097b3a31ad4ed3128b279","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/fadf5c6ef2f7d62a7a4097b3a31ad4ed3128b279"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/617c01e4d60bcbb90b4d49bf8fb240e1485e46d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T22:40:08Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T22:40:08Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-24] Strip unknown keys from submitted forms-data values\n\nReview finding: submitted `values` only validated known/required\nfields but let arbitrary extra keys pass through unbounded into the\njsonb column, contradicting data-model.md''s \"keyed like the schema''s\ncomponent ids\" contract.\n\nSDD-Task: T18","tree":{"sha":"82b35d3073bff3a35b7a559a9996d7988db7383b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/82b35d3073bff3a35b7a559a9996d7988db7383b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/617c01e4d60bcbb90b4d49bf8fb240e1485e46d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/617c01e4d60bcbb90b4d49bf8fb240e1485e46d7","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKDYxN2MwMWU0ZDYwYmNiYjkwYjRkNDliZjhmYjI0MGUxNDg1ZTQ2ZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/837b8cb520df4f16133e4f39f15369329cd55db7","sha":"837b8cb520df4f16133e4f39f15369329cd55db7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/837b8cb520df4f16133e4f39f15369329cd55db7"}],"sha":"617c01e4d60bcbb90b4d49bf8fb240e1485e46d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/617c01e4d60bcbb90b4d49bf8fb240e1485e46d7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/837b8cb520df4f16133e4f39f15369329cd55db7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T22:38:31Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T22:38:31Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-24] Serve the published version snapshot in Runtime, not the live draft\n\nReview finding: findPublishedById returned the mutable schemas.schema\ndraft instead of the pinned schemasVersions snapshot, so a Creator''s\npost-publish draft edits (even broken ones) went live in Runtime\nwithout a republish.\n\nSDD-Task: T16\nSDD-AC: AC-14\nSDD-AC: AC-15\nSDD-AC: AC-16\nSDD-AC: AC-18","tree":{"sha":"e5d645130d64e7a9c424bd7cd98d4420463fd6c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/e5d645130d64e7a9c424bd7cd98d4420463fd6c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/837b8cb520df4f16133e4f39f15369329cd55db7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/837b8cb520df4f16133e4f39f15369329cd55db7","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKDgzN2I4Y2I1MjBkZjRmMTYxMzNlNGYzOWYxNTM2OTMyOWNkNTVkYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/96474047db5b54fa1e9d442b0fdd70d8b332574f","sha":"96474047db5b54fa1e9d442b0fdd70d8b332574f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/96474047db5b54fa1e9d442b0fdd70d8b332574f"}],"sha":"837b8cb520df4f16133e4f39f15369329cd55db7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/837b8cb520df4f16133e4f39f15369329cd55db7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/96474047db5b54fa1e9d442b0fdd70d8b332574f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:42:20Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:42:20Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-24] Mark all runtime tasks done in tracker","tree":{"sha":"f1107f290d877c94c397821c1a2c18af9335ccb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/f1107f290d877c94c397821c1a2c18af9335ccb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/96474047db5b54fa1e9d442b0fdd70d8b332574f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/96474047db5b54fa1e9d442b0fdd70d8b332574f","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKDk2NDc0MDQ3ZGI1YjU0ZmExZTlkNDQyYjBmZGQ3MGQ4YjMzMjU3NGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/9d10e9a1c6baed12c11244ec75783b522df2e151","sha":"9d10e9a1c6baed12c11244ec75783b522df2e151","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/9d10e9a1c6baed12c11244ec75783b522df2e151"}],"sha":"96474047db5b54fa1e9d442b0fdd70d8b332574f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/96474047db5b54fa1e9d442b0fdd70d8b332574f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/9d10e9a1c6baed12c11244ec75783b522df2e151/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:41:56Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:41:56Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-24] Add Runtime e2e: happy path, validation-block, unpublished-hidden\n\nThree Playwright scenarios against the real routed UI (T13) + real\nAPI/DB: fill+submit+navigate-away+return with the same values\nprefilled (AC-17/19/30), a blocked invalid submit showing the\nfield-level error (AC-18), and an unpublished form staying out of\ndiscovery and unreachable by direct URL (AC-14). Test data (a\npublished form, a draft) is seeded via direct API calls (Playwright''s\nrequest context) against the seeded dev superuser account, rather\nthan driving Designer''s UI — keeps the suite scoped to Runtime and\nindependent of Designer''s own test coverage.\n\nFixed a pre-existing scaffold bug in playwright.config.ts:\nwebServer.command was `nx run runtime:serve` (starts only the\nruntime remote on :4202) while baseURL pointed at :4200 (shell) —\nRuntime is only reachable through the shell via native federation, so\nnavigating to shell routes would never have worked. Now starts the\nfull federated dev stack via the repo''s own fe:serve:shell:dev script.\n\nNOTE: not executed in this pass (by design, per discussion) — running\nit needs a full 4-app build + live API/DB + real browser automation,\na much heavier step than the tsc/eslint checks used to verify T9-T14.\nRun `nx e2e runtime-e2e` to execute for real.\n\nSDD-Task: T15\nSDD-AC: AC-14\nSDD-AC: AC-17\nSDD-AC: AC-18\nSDD-AC: AC-19\nSDD-AC: AC-30","tree":{"sha":"923f3457e0262f41e6bb6ca535c870c64469823c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/923f3457e0262f41e6bb6ca535c870c64469823c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/9d10e9a1c6baed12c11244ec75783b522df2e151","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/9d10e9a1c6baed12c11244ec75783b522df2e151","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKDlkMTBlOWExYzZiYWVkMTJjMTEyNDRlYzc1NzgzYjUyMmRmMmUxNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/a74b25badb888d47cdef9648a3623c6875bc3f7d","sha":"a74b25badb888d47cdef9648a3623c6875bc3f7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/a74b25badb888d47cdef9648a3623c6875bc3f7d"}],"sha":"9d10e9a1c6baed12c11244ec75783b522df2e151","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/9d10e9a1c6baed12c11244ec75783b522df2e151"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/a74b25badb888d47cdef9648a3623c6875bc3f7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:36:32Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:36:32Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-24] Wire Runtime routing into the shell\n\nPopulates the previously-empty runtime app.routes.ts: '''' -> form-list\n(AC-30 discovery), ''form-viewer/:schemaId'' -> form-viewer. The\nshell''s federation.config.js and app.routes.ts already register the\nruntime remote at ''runtime'' with only authGuard (no role guard,\ncorrectly matching sad.md: Runtime is reachable by all three roles)\nand expose ''./Routes'' -> app.routes.ts, so no shell-side change was\nneeded.\n\nFixed a real bug found while wiring this: form-list.openForm() called\nrouter.navigate([''form-viewer'', id]) without relativeTo. Angular\nresolves navigate() commands as absolute-from-root by default, so\nonce mounted under the shell''s /runtime prefix this would have sent\nusers to /form-viewer/:id instead of /runtime/form-viewer/:id.\ndesigner/form-list already threads relativeTo: this.route for the\nsame reason; runtime/form-list now does too.\n\nNOTE: still blocked on nx test runtime (pre-existing toolchain\nissue). Verified via tsc --noEmit against both tsconfig.app.json and\ntsconfig.spec.json (clean).\n\nSDD-Task: T13","tree":{"sha":"b71f468b44e61d6e485f1161a112418d62886c62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/b71f468b44e61d6e485f1161a112418d62886c62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/a74b25badb888d47cdef9648a3623c6875bc3f7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/a74b25badb888d47cdef9648a3623c6875bc3f7d","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKGE3NGIyNWJhZGI4ODhkNDdjZGVmOTY0OGEzNjIzYzY4NzViYzNmN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/ef054f4a702c2814960f93a55c919900b833b104","sha":"ef054f4a702c2814960f93a55c919900b833b104","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/ef054f4a702c2814960f93a55c919900b833b104"}],"sha":"a74b25badb888d47cdef9648a3623c6875bc3f7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/a74b25badb888d47cdef9648a3623c6875bc3f7d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/ef054f4a702c2814960f93a55c919900b833b104/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:34:02Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:34:02Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-24] Wire form-viewer to forms-data endpoints (prefill/submit/delete)\n\nGET''s response already carries the caller''s own prior values\nalongside the schema (T4); the form-build effect now also reads a\npriorValues signal and patches each matching control before\nconstructing the FormGroup, so returning to a form pre-fills it\n(AC-19). A valid submit calls PUT with { values: form.getRawValue() }\nand shows a confirmation message; delete calls DELETE, resets the\nform to its initial (empty) values via FormControl''s nonNullable\nreset semantics, and confirms (AC-17/AC-29). Delete is a\nRuntime-only affordance (schema x-actions has no delete-type action\nin Designer''s current model), rendered as a static button outside\nthe dynamic grid.\n\nNOTE: still blocked on nx test runtime (pre-existing toolchain\nissue). Verified via tsc --noEmit (clean) and by hand-tracing each\nnew test''s request/response/signal flow.\n\nSDD-Task: T12\nSDD-AC: AC-17\nSDD-AC: AC-19\nSDD-AC: AC-29","tree":{"sha":"64bf80f148c75f762fe78adf6b34ed30befd8fdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/64bf80f148c75f762fe78adf6b34ed30befd8fdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/ef054f4a702c2814960f93a55c919900b833b104","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/ef054f4a702c2814960f93a55c919900b833b104","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKGVmMDU0ZjRhNzAyYzI4MTQ5NjBmOTNhNTVjOTE5OTAwYjgzM2IxMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/65dc53153e13dc0a98048b62a279a6bd923a853b","sha":"65dc53153e13dc0a98048b62a279a6bd923a853b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/65dc53153e13dc0a98048b62a279a6bd923a853b"}],"sha":"ef054f4a702c2814960f93a55c919900b833b104","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/ef054f4a702c2814960f93a55c919900b833b104"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/65dc53153e13dc0a98048b62a279a6bd923a853b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:31:30Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:31:30Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-24] Add form-viewer submit validation (AC-18)\n\nA reactive FormGroup is (re)built from renderItems() whenever the\nschema loads, one FormControl per successfully-resolved field\n(button/error placeholders excluded): Validators.required for ids\nlisted in the schema''s required array, plus a custom validator for\nselect fields rejecting any value outside the field''s enum options.\nonSubmitClick() marks every control touched and returns early when\nthe group is invalid — no partial data is saved since T12 (which\nwill call the actual submit endpoint) hasn''t been wired yet.\nfieldError() surfaces a message per control for lib-input/text-area''s\nerror input and a manual <span> for lib-select (which has no error\ninput of its own).\n\nNOTE: still blocked on nx test runtime (pre-existing toolchain\nissue, see T9/T10 commits). Verified via tsc --noEmit against the\nspec''s tsconfig (clean) and by hand-tracing each new test''s\ntouched/valid/errors state through onSubmitClick/fieldError.\n\nSDD-Task: T11\nSDD-AC: AC-18","tree":{"sha":"4a5c0f716dc3a2da9d9321cfcdd121f55894f89f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/4a5c0f716dc3a2da9d9321cfcdd121f55894f89f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/65dc53153e13dc0a98048b62a279a6bd923a853b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/65dc53153e13dc0a98048b62a279a6bd923a853b","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKDY1ZGM1MzE1M2UxM2RjMGE5ODA0OGI2MmEyNzlhNmJkOTIzYTg1M2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/64bce509df356bf32e255af082ab8adc8aecae0b","sha":"64bce509df356bf32e255af082ab8adc8aecae0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/64bce509df356bf32e255af082ab8adc8aecae0b"}],"sha":"65dc53153e13dc0a98048b62a279a6bd923a853b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/65dc53153e13dc0a98048b62a279a6bd923a853b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/64bce509df356bf32e255af082ab8adc8aecae0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:27:34Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:27:34Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-24] Build Runtime form-viewer renderer with per-component error fallback\n\nFetches the gated GET /schemas/:schemaId/forms-data (T3/T4, AC-14)\nand renders each schema property via the shared client/libs/ui\nprimitives (lib-input/select/text-area/button), positioned with a\nCSS grid mirroring Designer''s col/row/w/h layout — a proportional\ngrid rather than canvas.ts''s pixel/ResizeObserver math, since\ncanvas.ts is edit-mode-only (drag/resize) and its own template just\nrenders static disabled placeholders, not bindable components.\n\nEach property is resolved through a try/catch (resolveField/\nresolveAction) that turns a missing x-ui block or unrecognized\ncomponent type into a per-item error placeholder instead of an\nuncaught error or blank screen (AC-16) — the rest of the form keeps\nrendering. All labels render via {{ }} interpolation only, matching\nAC-15 (never innerHTML/bypassSecurityTrust*).\n\nNo fill/submit logic yet (T11 validation, T12 data wiring).\n\nNOTE: nx test runtime is still blocked by the pre-existing toolchain\nissue (see T9''s commit). Verified instead via `tsc --noEmit` against\nthe spec''s tsconfig, which compiles clean — a strong signal the spec\nand implementation agree on shape, though not a substitute for\nactually running the assertions.\n\nSDD-Task: T10\nSDD-AC: AC-14\nSDD-AC: AC-15\nSDD-AC: AC-16","tree":{"sha":"b6e3be20a614e31184e8e50a968196064c2e6f9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/b6e3be20a614e31184e8e50a968196064c2e6f9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/64bce509df356bf32e255af082ab8adc8aecae0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/64bce509df356bf32e255af082ab8adc8aecae0b","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKDY0YmNlNTA5ZGYzNTZiZjMyZTI1NWFmMDgyYWI4YWRjOGFlY2FlMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/f56602ccf61c7b56990f77b2c67bc3f8b91fbc9f","sha":"f56602ccf61c7b56990f77b2c67bc3f8b91fbc9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/f56602ccf61c7b56990f77b2c67bc3f8b91fbc9f"}],"sha":"64bce509df356bf32e255af082ab8adc8aecae0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/64bce509df356bf32e255af082ab8adc8aecae0b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/f56602ccf61c7b56990f77b2c67bc3f8b91fbc9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:17:53Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T21:17:53Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-24] Build Runtime form-list discovery screen (AC-30)\n\nFetches GET /schemas/published (T5) via BaseHttpService and lists\neach as a link into form-viewer. Modelled on designer/form-list''s\ncomponent shape (OnPush, Signals, BaseHttpService) but deliberately\nsimpler — no ag-grid/CRUD, since this is an explicit temporary\nstopgap (PRD §8) with no edit/create/delete actions. Also wires\nHttpClient + the auth interceptor + API_BASE_URL into the runtime\napp (previously unconfigured, since no screen needed HTTP yet),\nmirroring designer''s app.config.ts and adding the matching\nenvironments/ files + production fileReplacement.\n\nNOTE: nx test runtime cannot currently be executed — confirmed via\nan isolated worktree that nx test designer fails identically on\npristine master with the same node_modules, so this is a pre-existing\nVitest/@angular-build toolchain issue unrelated to this feature. The\nspec below was hand-verified against the implementation but not\nexecuted; re-run once the toolchain is fixed.\n\nSDD-Task: T9\nSDD-AC: AC-30","tree":{"sha":"7b5a1fbd2dabf17f89bf219644e43baa104c44bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/7b5a1fbd2dabf17f89bf219644e43baa104c44bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/f56602ccf61c7b56990f77b2c67bc3f8b91fbc9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/f56602ccf61c7b56990f77b2c67bc3f8b91fbc9f","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKGY1NjYwMmNjZjYxYzdiNTY5OTBmNzdiMmM2N2JjM2Y4YjkxZmJjOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/b94cc0abc2b74ce55d8e8a2e2d615c2e78f0d2ce","sha":"b94cc0abc2b74ce55d8e8a2e2d615c2e78f0d2ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/b94cc0abc2b74ce55d8e8a2e2d615c2e78f0d2ce"}],"sha":"f56602ccf61c7b56990f77b2c67bc3f8b91fbc9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/f56602ccf61c7b56990f77b2c67bc3f8b91fbc9f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/b94cc0abc2b74ce55d8e8a2e2d615c2e78f0d2ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T20:33:56Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T20:33:56Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-24] Add PUT to BaseHttpService\n\nT12''s forms-data submit call needs PUT (idempotent create-or-\noverwrite); BaseHttpService only had get/post/patch/delete.","tree":{"sha":"491a3a39b25cfa646f17cfa77e81cb922544964d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/491a3a39b25cfa646f17cfa77e81cb922544964d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/b94cc0abc2b74ce55d8e8a2e2d615c2e78f0d2ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/b94cc0abc2b74ce55d8e8a2e2d615c2e78f0d2ce","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKGI5NGNjMGFiYzJiNzRjZTU1ZDhlOGEyZTJkNjE1YzJlNzhmMGQyY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/7e2156c5979123001d7e6448f21b31fb503e1aeb","sha":"7e2156c5979123001d7e6448f21b31fb503e1aeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/7e2156c5979123001d7e6448f21b31fb503e1aeb"}],"sha":"b94cc0abc2b74ce55d8e8a2e2d615c2e78f0d2ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/b94cc0abc2b74ce55d8e8a2e2d615c2e78f0d2ce"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/7e2156c5979123001d7e6448f21b31fb503e1aeb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T20:31:58Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T20:31:58Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-24] Regenerate api-client for the new forms-data endpoints\n\nnpm run api:generate-client against the live API with T4/T5''s routes\nregistered. Adds SubmitFormsDataDto; the discovery/get/delete\nendpoints reuse existing generated types. No hand-edits.\n\nSDD-Task: T8","tree":{"sha":"961d6b42bb1bd7f403c358c829b05fd60a8cffaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/961d6b42bb1bd7f403c358c829b05fd60a8cffaa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/7e2156c5979123001d7e6448f21b31fb503e1aeb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/7e2156c5979123001d7e6448f21b31fb503e1aeb","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKDdlMjE1NmM1OTc5MTIzMDAxZDdlNjQ0OGYyMWIzMWZiNTAzZTFhZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/a26cebe1b514e3791550b968428425f01217dfab","sha":"a26cebe1b514e3791550b968428425f01217dfab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/a26cebe1b514e3791550b968428425f01217dfab"}],"sha":"7e2156c5979123001d7e6448f21b31fb503e1aeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/7e2156c5979123001d7e6448f21b31fb503e1aeb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/a26cebe1b514e3791550b968428425f01217dfab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T20:30:44Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T20:30:44Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-24] Add cross-account forms-data isolation test against the real DB\n\nsad §10 names this test explicitly: \"a cross-account forms-data\nisolation test asserting account B''s read never returns account A''s\nsubmitted values.\" A mocked DRIZZLE_DB can''t prove real row\nfiltering (it returns whatever a test tells it to, regardless of the\nwhere clause), so this runs FormsDataService against the live dev\nPostgres with two seeded accounts of different roles (admin +\nuser), and cleans up everything it inserts. Also covers upsert\nnon-duplication (AC-17) and delete-own scoping (AC-29) the same way.\n\nValidation (AC-18) and the publish gate (AC-14) already have direct\nunit coverage from T3/T4; this consolidates the one guarantee that\nspecifically needs a real DB to be meaningful.\n\nSDD-Task: T7\nSDD-AC: AC-14\nSDD-AC: AC-17\nSDD-AC: AC-18\nSDD-AC: AC-19\nSDD-AC: AC-20\nSDD-AC: AC-29","tree":{"sha":"6b381f14137a22f0cab61e97136fb5aa8102eb3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/6b381f14137a22f0cab61e97136fb5aa8102eb3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/a26cebe1b514e3791550b968428425f01217dfab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/a26cebe1b514e3791550b968428425f01217dfab","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKGEyNmNlYmUxYjUxNGUzNzkxNTUwYjk2ODQyODQyNWYwMTIxN2RmYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/1bd884e4632f0d625440135a7864dd640f3d2231","sha":"1bd884e4632f0d625440135a7864dd640f3d2231","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/1bd884e4632f0d625440135a7864dd640f3d2231"}],"sha":"a26cebe1b514e3791550b968428425f01217dfab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/a26cebe1b514e3791550b968428425f01217dfab"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/1bd884e4632f0d625440135a7864dd640f3d2231/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T20:18:53Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T20:18:53Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-24] Wire FormsDataModule into the app\n\nPure composition: FormsDataModule imports SchemasModule (now\nexporting SchemasService) for the publish gate, and is registered in\nAppModule. Verified end-to-end against the live dev API + DB:\npublish-gate 404, validation-block on a missing required field,\nsubmit, prefill-on-return, and delete-own all round-trip correctly.\n\nSDD-Task: T6","tree":{"sha":"3d233d7eeedc562625d3e7587b017b850b923d2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/3d233d7eeedc562625d3e7587b017b850b923d2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/1bd884e4632f0d625440135a7864dd640f3d2231","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/1bd884e4632f0d625440135a7864dd640f3d2231","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKDFiZDg4NGU0NjMyZjBkNjI1NDQwMTM1YTc4NjRkZDY0MGYzZDIyMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/a413591da0547bca3871282c3e59e293ffda3cf2","sha":"a413591da0547bca3871282c3e59e293ffda3cf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/a413591da0547bca3871282c3e59e293ffda3cf2"}],"sha":"1bd884e4632f0d625440135a7864dd640f3d2231","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/1bd884e4632f0d625440135a7864dd640f3d2231"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/a413591da0547bca3871282c3e59e293ffda3cf2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:49:55Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:49:55Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-24] Add published-forms discovery endpoint\n\nGET /schemas/published lists schemas with at least one published\nversion, reusing the same \"has a published version\" signal as\nfindPublishedById. Available to any authenticated role — a\ndiscovery listing, not a permission grant (the actual per-form gate\nis findPublishedById on the get/submit path). Declared before the\n:id route so it isn''t swallowed by the param route.\n\nSDD-Task: T5\nSDD-AC: AC-30","tree":{"sha":"c0d82d680f563f3c72f8fa15632c406786fa2088","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/c0d82d680f563f3c72f8fa15632c406786fa2088"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/a413591da0547bca3871282c3e59e293ffda3cf2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/a413591da0547bca3871282c3e59e293ffda3cf2","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKGE0MTM1OTFkYTA1NDdiY2EzODcxMjgyYzNlNTllMjkzZmZkYTNjZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/e9de78a02fcf8b2bdb48c149f04e44bb39c25dec","sha":"e9de78a02fcf8b2bdb48c149f04e44bb39c25dec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/e9de78a02fcf8b2bdb48c149f04e44bb39c25dec"}],"sha":"a413591da0547bca3871282c3e59e293ffda3cf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/a413591da0547bca3871282c3e59e293ffda3cf2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/e9de78a02fcf8b2bdb48c149f04e44bb39c25dec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:46:25Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:46:25Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-24] Add FormsDataController (get/submit/delete own forms data)\n\nGET/PUT gate through SchemasService.findPublishedById (AC-14); PUT\nvalidates the submitted values against the schema''s required/enum\nfield definitions before calling FormsDataService.submit, rejecting\nwith field-level errors and saving nothing partial (AC-18). Every\nhandler reads the caller from req.user.userId only, never a\ncaller-supplied id (AC-20).\n\nSDD-Task: T4\nSDD-AC: AC-14\nSDD-AC: AC-17\nSDD-AC: AC-18\nSDD-AC: AC-19\nSDD-AC: AC-20\nSDD-AC: AC-29","tree":{"sha":"35c5d2d346665d5889ba34f4bcecb2022fd1efb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/35c5d2d346665d5889ba34f4bcecb2022fd1efb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/e9de78a02fcf8b2bdb48c149f04e44bb39c25dec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/e9de78a02fcf8b2bdb48c149f04e44bb39c25dec","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKGU5ZGU3OGEwMmZjZjhiMmJkYjQ4YzE0OWYwNGU0NGJiMzljMjVkZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/c53bf70c8cd59c253bb506c900c3548fa9faee85","sha":"c53bf70c8cd59c253bb506c900c3548fa9faee85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/c53bf70c8cd59c253bb506c900c3548fa9faee85"}],"sha":"e9de78a02fcf8b2bdb48c149f04e44bb39c25dec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/e9de78a02fcf8b2bdb48c149f04e44bb39c25dec"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/c53bf70c8cd59c253bb506c900c3548fa9faee85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:42:24Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:42:24Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-24] Implement FormsDataService (prefill, upsert submit, delete own)\n\nEvery method is scoped by userId from the caller (getOwn for prefill,\nsubmit as an upsert on the T1 unique(schema_id, user_id) constraint,\ndeleteOwn) — this is the isolation guarantee AC-20 depends on, and\nholds regardless of role. Validation of submitted values is\ndeliberately left to the controller/DTO layer (T4).\n\nSDD-Task: T2\nSDD-AC: AC-17\nSDD-AC: AC-19\nSDD-AC: AC-20\nSDD-AC: AC-29","tree":{"sha":"8be07fb3ecf2820862db2c7f12b54e21a3813ac8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/8be07fb3ecf2820862db2c7f12b54e21a3813ac8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/c53bf70c8cd59c253bb506c900c3548fa9faee85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/c53bf70c8cd59c253bb506c900c3548fa9faee85","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKGM1M2JmNzBjOGNkNTljMjUzYmI1MDZjOTAwYzM1NDhmYTlmYWVlODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/e8f9cfe64618337e622152fbaecb78e91c3c39ef","sha":"e8f9cfe64618337e622152fbaecb78e91c3c39ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/e8f9cfe64618337e622152fbaecb78e91c3c39ef"}],"sha":"c53bf70c8cd59c253bb506c900c3548fa9faee85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/c53bf70c8cd59c253bb506c900c3548fa9faee85"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/e8f9cfe64618337e622152fbaecb78e91c3c39ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:40:55Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:40:55Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-24] Add SchemasService.findPublishedById (published-only gate)\n\nThe single choke point AC-14 depends on: every Runtime-facing read\nmust route through this instead of the general-purpose findById,\nwhich intentionally shows unpublished drafts to their Creator.\n\nSDD-Task: T3\nSDD-AC: AC-14","tree":{"sha":"3409e9c444d