0148","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/9d1c812f8c9e241dcd5c421141a2729d20900148"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/63896c0ecfa672e46ec841788a38fbe05f88f632/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T21:24:57Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T21:24:57Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-22] Increase canvas grid density with square-dot markers for more precise component placing\n\nSwitch the designer canvas from a 12-column line grid to a 64-column\nsquare-dot grid whose row height tracks the actual column width, then\nscale default/stored component spans 4x so existing layouts stay\nlegible at the finer resolution.","tree":{"sha":"d3396681c1f0327f68c46bd5c4b389c5931995c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/d3396681c1f0327f68c46bd5c4b389c5931995c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/63896c0ecfa672e46ec841788a38fbe05f88f632","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/63896c0ecfa672e46ec841788a38fbe05f88f632","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKDYzODk2YzBlY2ZhNjcyZTQ2ZWM4NDE3ODhhMzhmYmUwNWY4OGY2MzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/423f75b88c02a7ec263849ef8137407f9f442d19","sha":"423f75b88c02a7ec263849ef8137407f9f442d19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/423f75b88c02a7ec263849ef8137407f9f442d19"}],"sha":"63896c0ecfa672e46ec841788a38fbe05f88f632","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/63896c0ecfa672e46ec841788a38fbe05f88f632"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/423f75b8