6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-21T21:14:28Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-21T21:37:51Z","email":"oleksandrvorovchenko@Oleksandrs-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Oleksandr Vorovchenko"},"message":"[CF-2] Add NestJS backend API (auth + schemas CRUD)\n\n- Initialize NX workspace with @nx/nest plugin\n- Scaffold NestJS app in server/api (moved from apps/api)\n- DrizzleModule: provides typed DB client as injectable token\n- AuthModule: POST /auth/register + /auth/login → JWT (bcrypt rounds=12)\n- SchemasModule: full CRUD + publish + versions endpoints\n- Drizzle relational queries with `with: { type: true }` for eager loading\n- Swagger/OpenAPI at /api/docs with Bearer auth support\n- Global ValidationPipe, URI versioning (/api/v1/...), CORS enabled\n- Move all secrets to .env (gitignored); docker-compose uses ${VAR} substitution\n- Add .DS_Store and .claude/ to .gitignore\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"75210ca32ed2571350ba74f20ca9a656518e2356","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/trees/75210ca32ed2571350ba74f20ca9a656518e2356"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/git/commits/fae6fda8451166d2964d0e24f64d667cbf71f76e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/fae6fda8451166d2964d0e24f64d667cbf71f76e","node_id":"C_kwDORtN9_toAKGZhZTZmZGE4NDUxMTY2ZDI5NjRkMGUyNGY2NGQ2NjdjYmY3MWY3NmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shur1k/custom-forms/commit/8d311f090157de52712bf847096c457441dacb76","sha":"8d311f090157de52712bf847096c457441dacb76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shur1k/custom-forms/commits/8d311f090157de52712bf847096c457441dacb76"}],"sha":"fae6fda8451166d2964d0e24f64d667cbf71f76e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos