6523?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pranavpanchal1326","id":235696523,"login":"pranavpanchal1326","node_id":"U_kgDODgxxiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commits/75df3af1e015e470f981afa9d4546e4fd5873834/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:49:26Z","email":"pranavpanchal1326@gmail.com","name":"pranavpanchal1326"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:49:26Z","email":"pranavpanchal1326@gmail.com","name":"pranavpanchal1326"},"message":"feat(ui-shell): Modern Vault redesign + landing page\n\nEvolve the palette from muddy-brass heritage to a modern, luminous\nsystem while keeping the soul (the eye, the vigilance, paper=fact):\n- tokens v2: near-black green base, champagne-gold accent (grad), vivid\n  mint, cleaner crimson signal; radius scale (curves everywhere), soft\n  glow + glass, modern shadow scale, spring easing; legacy --brass/\n  --phosphor/--oxblood names aliased so the canon keeps working\n- Landing page: gradient-mesh hero with the watching eye, gold-gradient\n  display type, five curved engine cards, stats band, the creed, footer;\n  reveal-on-scroll; lightened decorative motion (dropped the viewport-\n  spanning marquee that thrashed the compositor)\n- Controls: gold pill buttons (+ghost), curved boxed fields + TOTP\n- Shell: rounded gold nav pills, glass, curved user card, vault gradient\n- Alert rows: rounded hover-lift, crimson glow notch\n- Desk-width gate scoped to the console only (was bleeding onto landing)\n\nVerified live at 1440px: landing (hero/engines/creed), teller login,\nand the alert queue populated by the recruiter_fanout campaign.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"074eec131b2fa9877278d26464ca32f93edffea2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/git/trees/074eec131b2fa9877278d26464ca32f93edffea2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/git/commits/75df3af1e015e470f981afa9d4546e4fd5873834","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235696523?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pranavpanchal1326","id":235696523,"login":"pranavpanchal1326","node_id":"U_kgDODgxxiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commit/75df3af1e015e470f981afa9d4546e4fd5873834","node_id":"C_kwDORtc-YtoAKDc1ZGYzYWYxZTAxNWU0NzBmOTgxYWZhOWQ0NTQ2ZTRmZDU4NzM4MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commit/9ecb7e39003e830e60bfdec081f27bae3b386dd4","sha":"9ecb7e39003e830e60bfdec081f27bae3b386dd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commits/9ecb7e39003e830e60bfdec081f27bae3b386dd4"}],"sha":"75df3af1e015e470f981afa9d4546e4fd5873834","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commits/75df3af1e015e470f981afa9d4546e4fd5873834"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235696523?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pranavpanchal1326","id":235696523,"login":"pranavpanchal1326","node_id":"U_kgDODgxxiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commits/9ecb7e39003e830e60bfdec081f27bae3b386dd4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:25:33Z","email":"pranavpanchal1326@gmail.com","name":"pranavpanchal1326"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:25:33Z","email":"pranavpanchal1326@gmail.com","name":"pranavpanchal1326"},"message":"fix(ui-shell): WS events as signals + view boundary + MFA enrolment stage\n\n- Alert Queue treats alert.raised as a refetch signal (burst-debounced 400ms)\n  instead of trusting the slim WS payload as a full Alert — /alerts stays the\n  single source of truth (Law 2); fixes crash on live arrivals\n- Per-view error boundary: a jammed desk shows a RETURNED stamp, never a\n  blank app (PRD reliability: one broken screen never blanks the app)\n- First-login MFA enrolment: \"Your key is cut once.\" — otpauth URI rendered\n  as ink-on-ivory QR exactly once, never as text (Law 3)\n- Alerts status filter applied client-side (backend takes single status only)\n\nVerified end-to-end against the live backend: login -> enrolment QR -> TOTP\n-> vault door -> Alert Queue populated by the recruiter_fanout campaign\n(22 IMMINENT / 1 CRITICAL, real WarmthScores, live WS arrivals).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0371f4be477d4effc1fc2cafa867c5750fbd0570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/git/trees/0371f4be477d4effc1fc2cafa867c5750fbd0570"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/git/commits/9ecb7e39003e830e60bfdec081f27bae3b386dd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235696523?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pranavpanchal1326","id":235696523,"login":"pranavpanchal1326","node_id":"U_kgDODgxxiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commit/9ecb7e39003e830e60bfdec081f27bae3b386dd4","node_id":"C_kwDORtc-YtoAKDllY2I3ZTM5MDAzZTgzMGU2MGJmZGVjMDgxZjI3YmFlM2IzODZkZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commit/88d0060d050fe7b4ee4e14bd702a1c8077107199","sha":"88d0060d050fe7b4ee4e14bd702a1c8077107199","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commits/88d0060d050fe7b4ee4e14bd702a1c8077107199"}],"sha":"9ecb7e39003e830e60bfdec081f27bae3b386dd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commits/9ecb7e39003e830e60bfdec081f27bae3b386dd4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235696523?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pranavpanchal1326","id":235696523,"login":"pranavpanchal1326","node_id":"U_kgDODgxxiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranavpanchal1326","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commits/88d0060d050fe7b4ee4e14bd702a1c8077107199/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:16:12Z","email":"pranavpanchal1326@gmail.com","name":"pranavpanchal1326"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T17:16:12Z","email":"pranavpanchal1326@gmail.com","name":"pranavpanchal1326"},"message":"feat(ui-shell): The Hundred Eyes foundation — tokens, canon, teller window, alert queue\n\nDesign system v1.0 (Paper = fact, Light = analysis):\n- tokens.css: vault greens, paper/ink, brass, rationed phosphor, oxblood;\n  three voices (Playfair/Inter/Plex Mono); mechanical+optical motion tokens\n- Component canon: the Eye (rate-limited blink, velocity iris), WarmthScore\n  galvanometer dial (16/48/96, phosphor trail), ink stamps (seeded jitter,\n  ink-bleed mask), brass lamps, brass-plate buttons, paper fields, TOTP boxes\n- App shell: nav rail, Meridian hairline, Margin of the Watch with the\n  live-WS-driven Eye; auth context over /auth/me\n- Teller window login: credentials -> MFA challenge -> 6 engraved digit\n  boxes -> vault door (600ms, once, reduced-motion honored)\n- Alert Queue: severity in-trays, canonical 36px rows (SHAP chips, taint\n  stamp, SLA burn coloring, micro-dial), WS arrivals with brass shimmer,\n  honest empty/error/skeleton states\n- Typed client generated from contracts/openapi.yaml (npm run gen:api);\n  envelope + RFC-7807; token rotation; zero mock data anywhere (Law 1-3)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"54b12a17384708d8eba59bc7fed3f3ee86e32473","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/git/trees/54b12a17384708d8eba59bc7fed3f3ee86e32473"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/git/commits/88