","node_id":"U_kgDOB7R4tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commits/635680ba0cb1a6ee8108edecb91aef56e0dc1dd4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T05:57:55Z","email":"belhekaraditya96@gmail.com","name":"AdityaBelhekar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T05:57:55Z","email":"belhekaraditya96@gmail.com","name":"AdityaBelhekar"},"message":"feat(cases+compliance): case lifecycle + HMAC audit ledger + fairness\n\nCases (PRD §5.4):\n- Full lifecycle OPEN → UNDER_REVIEW → PENDING_MLRO → CLOSED_CONFIRMED_MULE |\n  CLOSED_FALSE_POSITIVE. Open-from-alert links account + alert and stamps the alert.\n- Notes, evidence attachments, and a full state-transition activity log.\n- Closing is MLRO-only (CLOSE_CASE); every transition is audit-logged.\n\nCompliance (PRD §5.9):\n- Append-only HMAC hash-chained audit ledger. record() chains each entry to the\n  previous; verify_chain() recomputes end-to-end — the \"Verify ledger\" action runs\n  the real check. Freezes + case transitions are recorded.\n- GET /audit exposes only an 8-char fingerprint per entry, never the HMAC key or\n  full hash material (Law 3). Tampering is detected (verified in tests).\n- /compliance/fairness computes false-positive rates by segment from real data\n  (the DPDP story); /compliance/reports lists the scheduled-report registry.\n\nRBAC verified: COMPLIANCE_AUDITOR reads the ledger but is 403 on customer accounts.\n\nRuff green; 25/25 tests pass. Contract: 39 paths, 50 schemas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d62cb33760e049ca65e6edb184e3beef0bf612ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/git/trees/d62cb33760e049ca65e6edb184e3beef0bf612ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/git/commits/635680ba0cb1a6ee8108edecb91aef56e0dc1dd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129267894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdityaBelhekar","id":129267894,"login":"AdityaBelhekar","node_id":"U_kgDOB7R4tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commit/635680ba0cb1a6ee8108edecb91aef56e0dc1dd4","node_id":"C_kwDORtc-YtoAKDYzNTY4MGJhMGNiMWE2ZWU4MTA4ZWRlY2I5MWFlZjU2ZTBkYzFkZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commit/f28df2883127bc9a509a62299d6130081b4137ab","sha":"f28df2883127bc9a509a62299d6130081b4137ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commits/f28df2883127bc9a509a62299d6130081b4137ab"}],"sha":"635680ba0cb1a6ee