elhekaraditya96@gmail.com","name":"AdityaBelhekar"},"message":"merge(backend-pipeline): scoring engine, simulator, live feed, alert queue\n\nThe spine is alive: real transactions -> real scores -> real alerts over WS.\n14/14 tests green.","tree":{"sha":"906fcefb4944840f8b97f5469fa7ec358ffb5698","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/git/trees/906fcefb4944840f8b97f5469fa7ec358ffb5698"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/git/commits/51ea18c34cfbc6e322cb63c4e8d02b6d69f04b25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129267894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdityaBelhekar","id":129267894,"login":"AdityaBelhekar","node_id":"U_kgDOB7R4tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commit/51ea18c34cfbc6e322cb63c4e8d02b6d69f04b25","node_id":"C_kwDORtc-YtoAKDUxZWExOGMzNGNmYmM2ZTMyMmNiNjNjNGU4ZDAyYjZkNjlmMDRiMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commit/5706e57767575376cd5615981191ebd21cf05302","sha":"5706e57767575376cd5615981191ebd21cf05302","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commits/5706e57767575376cd5615981191ebd21cf05302"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commit/c5ecd4df06e31620bde224e78b2c35b677fbd041","sha":"c5ecd4df06e31620bde224e78b2c35b677fbd041","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commits/c5ecd4df06e31620bde224e78b2c35b677fbd041"}],"sha":"51ea18c34cfbc6e322cb63c4e8d02b6d69f04b25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commits/51ea18c34cfbc6e322cb63c4e8d02b6d69f04b25"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129267894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AdityaBelhekar","id":129267894,"login":"AdityaBelhekar","node_id":"U_kgDOB7R4tg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdityaBelhekar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/commits/c5ecd4df06e31620bde224e78b2c35b677fbd041/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T20:45:07Z","email":"belhekaraditya96@gmail.com","name":"AdityaBelhekar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T20:45:07Z","email":"belhekaraditya96@gmail.com","name":"AdityaBelhekar"},"message":"feat(pipeline): WarmthScore engine + seeded simulator + Live Feed + Alert Queue\n\nThe heart of the spine — this is where Law 2 comes alive. Every number is computed\nfrom real (simulated) transactions flowing through the real pipeline.\n\nDomain:\n- Models: Account, Transaction, Device, ScoreHistory, Alert, Event.\n- Vocabulary: WarmthScore bands (CLEAN..IMMINENT) mapped onto the proven 7-tier\n  graduated response; recommended status never auto-downgrades a human freeze.\n\nWarmthScore engine (proven V2 IP, re-homed off Kafka):\n- 6-signal ensemble (velocity, round-trip, structuring, dormant+device, profile\n  mismatch, SIM-swap) → 0-100 score with per-signal SHAP contributions.\n- Verified separation: legit avg ~0.8 vs mule avg ~65; clear mules reach HOT.\n  CRITICAL/IMMINENT are reserved for network agreement (taint/graph, next).\n\nSimulator (PRD §5.2 — a first-class service, not a demo script):\n- Deterministic seeded RNG + YAML campaigns (legit_baseline, recruiter_fanout).\n- Streams the plan through the real pipeline tick-by-tick; same seed replays\n  identically, but scores/alerts are genuinely computed.\n\nPipeline + Live Feed + Alert Queue:\n- transaction -> rescore -> alert cascade with SLA deadlines (PMLA §12).\n- Event bus: DB-persisted monotonic events + in-process WS fan-out; /feed/recent\n  backfill (no gaps/dupes), /metrics/pulse KPIs, WS /stream with heartbeat.\n- Alerts API: cursor pagination, server sort, PATCH/escalate, RBAC-gated\n  (SYS_ADMIN walled off — verified 403). Masked account refs everywhere (Law 3).\n- Sim controls (SYS_ADMIN): load/start/pause/reset + status.\n\nRuff green; 14/14 tests pass (health, auth, pipeline cascade, alerts API + RBAC).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"906fcefb4944840f8b97f5469fa7ec358ffb5698","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/git/trees/906fcefb4944840f8b97f5469fa7ec358ffb5698"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranavpanchal1326/ARGUS-PRISM/git/commits/c5ecd4df06e31