","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkayiwa","id":1390773,"login":"dkayiwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTA3NzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/commits/5f5ccec5f497c99fd50800a4ea99ddbc30f810b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:49:43Z","email":"dkayiwa@openmrs.org","name":"dkayiwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:49:43Z","email":"dkayiwa@openmrs.org","name":"dkayiwa"},"message":"fix: show the model reasoning''s caveat on hover only\n\nThe caveat was drawn as a line inside the open reasoning panel, so it repeated under every answer\nwhose reasoning was open. It now lives only on the \"Model reasoning\" summary, as its title: shown\non hover and read as the summary''s accessible description. A reader who never hovers, such as a\ntouch user, no longer sees it on the open streaming panel; that is the trade chosen\n(openmrs-module-chartsearchai#254).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"54a2d9983f4516a506a1e44d6d7d90f40c7d1e0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/git/trees/54a2d9983f4516a506a1e44d6d7d90f40c7d1e0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/git/