her orders, so it is now drawn on one\nline tagged \"Not in the answer\", its detail behind Show details, and does not\ncount towards collapsing the box. A finding against one of her own orders\nthe answer leaves out is still drawn in full. notInTheAnswer shares\ncompactChips'' reading of which findings the answer cites.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: draw a reworded cited finding on one line tagged to compare\n\nA cited finding that unfaithfullyRenderedCitations alone names (the answer\nreproduced its record and then said something different inside the same\nsentence) was drawn in full. It is now drawn on one line tagged \"Reworded in\nthe answer, compare\", the record''s own words behind Show details. It keeps\nthe box open, so the tag is seen. A finding another check also names, or any\nanswer-wide check reporting, still draws in full.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxCsLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA978QAJp1jjOJ3sGPiqbCRJTytRhb\nKSkp/kWpqSBxRAW+nTaShKiF9FfvbQ9uCdB3CUQuEyP8cJFYQr+agk16NSbd3gBg\nlfVU3wePjh5Q+gEvRntsHywB5YzUAs4hW/bIPhZxMh52uWv2+OyC3IIHSKTQoqfi\nQcGsD/a5MqWM6PaXpjd0EWPb4fZx36m+j3aHg1V1cnGhgvijCVbIKt55BkKatzfd\n1OGl7ZZSuNAWTzHpg6WPmNhJDObb5H2Gza014h3erV2C2VjpfoZ1WBv3RapYDdUf\noFf6I/uHYLG1OnlppSHbNcyZzhsFMyBjRoV7n4JIlZX0aBOvANlPYLg1j46Jx/82\nqC+ljX+EZkD0vgfEsNSVuA57/3jaaOsBseVNUEDJON6+a4TlOj+fnzsvt/DiBzhD\nqzO62XOD97MXeZF61ZfRdulN4SxqS1iCSUVCTlEPqR7C+6JpwvC8dsS/rngf48PM\nAJGVZeANi0ZEZJCiSgQuamr1LOGOc1QcuVPenzmAIWxbEpDbkWf3Qx85eeoryltV\nTbzyi0kVWLW4hkQKJKftBy6nTh7N4eleaRUgwP754gFSU45lmmQgK8o/y3gvlzN3\n+nE4FGLOaNdLC2EzFEPFdadF83Lpgh+Y03VJaRkhrs840NTGrpeI8M7uihf5afzS\nhHLE1vwnk5QUWrZSZ3+W\n=aVts\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T22:56:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1986444