er, and tag it with that marker alone (#53)\n\nWhere a chip carries findingCitation (openmrs-module-chartsearchai#579, ADR Decision 138), the\nrecord number of its own finding, compactChips joins on it: the chip folds exactly where the answer\ncites that record, tagged \"See [51] in the answer\" rather than every marker of a shared key. The\nfluconazole chips are now tagged [50] and [51] apart, and on the rifampicin answer the cited Major\nfolds while the uncited Minor sharing its key stays in full. A chip without the key keeps #50''s\nshared-key rule. README updated.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PYN5xzwdktSVV3LrU5nuPG\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvjdsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAI2IQABehvh1Ctgq2XlLBP9AJ6yUx\nWw493VrrHpaV3Uv2nE47fgBrNylGKCAfUjKJq0Lexstlu3wMHVh6sWGSNxmzv+QB\n29KZGAI0kBuCNwIFNeFUPS3xee/nZ62JHnu1Dr+2WZYHsVxj9iphtzniQzchrLk7\n1O/63Gqze9pP4xtSiJNMJR+koRKMUU4x5M8cIhGaysdgYPrTLX7gFtKhbGnD78ZU\nM+RNAEfau3kgDTiGRL4bx8Q+H6isMoTC90mlVqakCAUOwItQvTOEJ+hviwzPj1gu\nms1i9oK8bGt5SypkBQpIblGkC0Q9MpPXp7FO36tNa/e+ZMPQHJPwbKL6hiLUk6HJ\noBrDqR/FWMUdGPX7mriWVjUUK0W/lZTODZp7qR6rsMVGiGg2zsl/V9bAbUQsIX9C\nhRoZUETupRbnDNQGAxsdJzujMlGe19d+NVKltnctgrPbp6rZnXrvyu6c8EaJvNoI\n054ZqYhs3al37b4t1dlxOwx3Lc7hpon4IEgXpbEwosG2FStq5tyK69ez8qG7WoHG\nkY7VBVLdqLPmhqtmDbiwZy3Ebg9ptZDC716oCYpq4WCM+RF75KpAzq3FNdnd4jZs\nP9WzDnGARQV4qc9TUKM0fdDd0UQxUnrcS8vx8BSQFVeiuztALumhA1pae39iTWHe\n/sG/yulbzsRo6o6J+dDV\n=2cVI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T10:35:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","ht