ther_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkayiwa","id":1390773,"login":"dkayiwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTA3NzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/commits/f4c9184335a8574815aa129734cff405e4291e56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:45:22Z","email":"dkayiwa@openmrs.org","name":"dkayiwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:45:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: draw a safety chip about a drug other than the one asked about behind the closed line (#49)\n\nA chip marked aboutADrugOtherThanTheOneProposed (openmrs-module-chartsearchai#578, ADR Decision 137),\nsuch as the listed nevirapine against her lidocaine on a question proposing fluconazole, joins the\nchips about her other medications behind the closed line. The line still says \"findings about other\nmedications this patient takes\" where every chip behind it is her own prescription, and otherwise\n\"findings not about the drug asked about\". Only `true` moves a chip.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PYN5xzwdktSVV3LrU5nuPG\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b76f2c23ffe3096c82bf3b3c5e5a6e1af71414c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/git/trees/0b76f2c23ffe3096c82bf3b3c5e5a6e1af71414c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/git/commits/f4c9184335a8574815