026-09-30T18:44:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: tag a one-line safety chip with the marker the answer cites it at (#44)\n\n\"Cited in the answer\" said a folded chip''s detail was in the answer, but not where, so checking it\nmeant rereading the paragraph. The tag now names the marker: \"See [46] in the answer\", every such\nmarker in order where the answer cites the finding more than once. compactChips returns each\nqualifying chip''s cited indexes, read off the same intersection of the answer''s markers and its\nsafety_finding references that decides whether it qualifies, so a record the answer never cites is\nnever named.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PYN5xzwdktSVV3LrU5nuPG\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a74d4a8373e4ba81908fea3c22cc198a8867f68f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/git/trees/a74d4a8373e4ba81908fea3c22cc198a8867f68f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/git/commits/c23307f040b2fdae5befc7e09ee8e4f321e8d4db","verification":{"payload":"tree a74d4a8373e4ba81908fea3c22cc198a8867f68f\nparent 3eddbd8dabec02d0e279ab87ac56ff7bd37db5af\nauthor dkayiwa <dkayiwa@openmrs.org> 1790793893 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790793893 +0300\n\nfeat: tag a one-line safety chip with the marker the answer cites it at (#44)\n\n\"Cited in the answer\" said a folded chip''s detail was in the answer, but not where, so checking it\nmeant rereading the paragraph. The tag now names the marker: \"See [46] in the answer\", every such\nmarker in order where the answer cites the finding more than once. compactChips returns each\nqualifying chip''s cited indexes, read off the same intersection of the answer''s markers and its\nsafety_finding references that decides whether it qualifies, so a record the answer never cites is\nnever named.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PYN5xzwdk