.github.com/users/dkayiwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkayiwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/commits/219242970a8431ddabc23caf357b0540d9fb037c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T17:19:51Z","email":"dkayiwa@openmrs.org","name":"dkayiwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T17:19:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: name her own order on a contraindication she is already prescribed, and drop the tag where it said nothing (#41)\n\n\"About a current medication\" was drawn on every chip the backend raised from one of her active\norders. On an interaction chip the words already say \"active order\", and behind the\nother-medications line the line already says it, so there it repeated itself. It carries information\nonly on a contraindication, whose words are the same whether she takes the drug or a question\nproposes it. There it now names the order from currentMedicationOrders (\"Already prescribed: Advil\n400mg\"), or says \"Already prescribed\" where an older backend sends no orders. It is never named from\n`drug`, the substance.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PYN5xzwdktSVV3LrU5nuPG\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d8444fa6f990ee0f25622d724cf1a2d894f3708","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/git/trees/8d8444fa6f990ee0f25622d724cf1a2d894f3708"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/git/commits/219242970a8431ddabc23caf357b0540d9fb037c","verification":{"payload":"tree 8d8444fa6f990ee0f25622d724cf1a2d894f3708\nparent d072d7fd76a8ec046c78e8ff285fd1d2071eb37a\nauthor dkayiwa <dkayiwa@openmrs.org> 1790788791 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790788791 +0300\n\nfeat: name her own order on a contraindication she is already prescribed, and drop the tag where it said nothing (#41)\n\n\"About a current medication\" was drawn on every chip the backend raised from one of her active\norders. On an interaction chip the words already say \"active order\", and behind the\nother-medications line the line already says it, so there it repeated itself. It carries information\nonly on a contraindication, whose words are the same whether she takes the drug or a question\nproposes it. There it now names the order from currentMedicationOrders (\"Already prescribed: Advil\n400mg\"), or says \"Already prescribed\" where an older backend sends no orders. It is never named from\n`drug`, the substance.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PYN5xzwdktSVV3LrU5nuPG\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvUS3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvzcQAIOcJ0ib1aI4MlOYYfwYQTSN\nuKijx02OVsZqFbFeONtu3AKi0cmqr8Xa0EP1x7SyHEtwIlIZg6BamRJFQpHiTFGw\n46hhq/GmxkX0FncViP/JEFdoITu2ACoXqC0rowEPjetE72694STEV6U9Yb0Up2wQ\nP35AlmDoqWL8txufhA++KbGmPDcLlcqbFRFbhYMT8GSMIlazYnLij5K9eYgOdg25\nBee55j30amncV/I2Re6SC5kwP6ra7EJyC3drCSpHvqa61YcdjcWOaooBG3pEPgLH\njGpU44Zc2pfsxem0pEwqscPiGEDXQM0JHeMoDgqWMQQC9wdPMcZsdnzm2CMPM2mU\nN+kPB/7/XDuAR1GDkKJTJTzsTo2ugClLUOFy0OOeGHpgqpxklzSYcU5zWcm6DBUo\n38Sq2ZkZTySkR54Sxc1I7E87g7q9J6jGEk4olVZhjJoB4xy6e3nmoT9pbGB8huWD\nP5gsX0Gk+XDsR8RWFL8O1bqutwEYjpY6H1MbjqEWFLcfrZfHmQo36I12paIwXGfu\nQXXRrZyMEtJHj79s0cDweQz37zmoAzK1t/PW24pcf36vyzQB/DqHFHcvBjCU9xRZ\nmB5mUps/mdwR5aRtW6NbEGck/hlzP4WIe+YNsWWi9RR9VMiGqyKjrPfUR6sOhSjB\nLyU+a0XbjrKoBpZjYxKE\n=ZAKE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T17:19:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/use