red and empty, is drawn on one line with its detail behind Show details. Where every chip in the safety box qualifies, the box collapses to ''Safety checks: N finding(s), stated in the answer'' with Show safety checks. Anything short of that draws as before.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PYN5xzwdktSVV3LrU5nuPG","tree":{"sha":"ed1a31f1f89efd269ac194b0c57c03d56b7ea6f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/git/trees/ed1a31f1f89efd269ac194b0c57c03d56b7ea6f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/git/commits/242b0994efed824f01c472e3a03407287a348445","verification":{"payload":"tree ed1a31f1f89efd269ac194b0c57c03d56b7ea6f2\nparent 6c4e7260fc92a08f4982d73dce594939a12ebd39\nauthor dkayiwa <dkayiwa@openmrs.org> 1790773464 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790773464 +0300\n\n(feat) Draw a safety chip the answer already cites on one line, and collapse the box when every chip is one (#35)\n\nA chip the answer''s own markers cite, whose type:drug key no other chip shares, with every backend fidelity check measured and empty, is drawn on one line with its detail behind Show details. Where every chip in the safety box qualifies, the box collapses to ''Safety checks: N finding(s), stated in the answer'' with Show safety checks. Anything short of that draws as before.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PYN5xzwdktSVV3LrU5nuPG","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvQjYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATVgQAJHeMjlBzgtz+rZQDDcEBACN\nKgneTRsQarJ9r1jo8JeXJ0UW+BDMyUhaDyWH6cTFaSF9OgWeGtfOSCgOD3doWlB1\nYfgpkN7nQssKXK7NvFgtLXFd72L8EDojenrNt+gq35Tuq0AqbfvOmRJqtqEUHRea\nAcrB+kniBK+wWWvpIJR1SKtODY7x+iDlmOyUzgdAgQXKLSOSgsN6YIiaPfvjnsNZ\npXMPZMto6ZOl8La52JPT13mcN4MhLR7iws4QQnGGw6ULnFEO2tzDhzOESsbELEnp\n7mIQPxpRbloi/FRHyWHeoVuFY3jVl2EhJZQ+VWY18dXGCL