tps://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/commits/7c0fc72ac70eca891077ef8c9f6c483a6513eda3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T10:10:03Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"denniskigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T10:10:03Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"denniskigen"},"message":"(chore) Update OpenMRS dependencies\n\nBumps @openmrs/esm-framework, @openmrs/esm-styleguide, and openmrs to\n9.0.3-pre.4550. The new framework''s dist/index.d.ts re-exports from\n@openmrs/esm-globals/src/public, which under classic \"node\" module\nresolution resolves to the source .ts file. That file redeclares\n__webpack_share_scopes__, conflicting with the declaration in\nesm-globals/dist/types.d.ts and breaking `yarn typescript`.\n\nSwitch moduleResolution to \"bundler\" so the exports map is honored and\nthe subpath resolves to dist/public.d.ts. Mirrors the fix applied in\nopenmrs-esm-patient-chart#3235.","tree":{"sha":"413b693b7ce953b2897fbdb30d3ba9a497a0d01b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/git/trees/413b693b7ce953b2897fbdb30d3ba9a497a0d01b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/git/commits/7c0fc72ac70eca891077ef8c9f6c483a6513eda3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/commit/7c0fc72ac70eca891077ef8c9f6c483a6513eda3","node_id":"C_kwDORtovsNoAKDdjMGZjNzJhYzcwZWNhODkxMDc3ZWY4YzlmNmM0ODNhNjUxM2VkYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/commit/167b4b4e4d898fd3daef1a3bda65fed71303fc1b","sha":"167b4b4e4d898fd3daef1a3bda65fed71303fc1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/commits/167b4b4e4d898fd3daef1a3bda65fed71303fc1b"}],"sha":"7c0fc72ac70eca891077ef8c9f6c483a6513eda3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/commits/7c0fc72ac70eca891077ef8c9f6c483a6513eda3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34070216?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NethmiRodrigo","id":34070216,"login":"NethmiRodrigo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MDcwMjE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/commits/167b4b4e4d898fd3daef1a3bda65fed71303fc1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T13:20:40Z","email":"nethmi@openmrs.org","name":"Nethmi Rodrigo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T13:20:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(feat) Redesign AI chart search panel as persistent chat history (#3)\n\n* refactor(hook): replace single-answer state with messages array in useChartSearchAi\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(ui): redesign AI Chart Search panel as persistent chat history\n\n* fix(chat-history): address pre-merge issues from code review\n\n- Fix stopCurrent race: use inFlightMessageIdRef to target message by ID\n- Remove empty message bubble when stop fires before any answer arrives\n- Null abortControllerRef on unmount to prevent hook lock on remount\n- Add isMountedRef guard to skip state updates after unmount\n- Fix SSE buffer flush to process all remaining lines, not just first\n- Add try/catch + rethrow to submitFeedback for error visibility\n- Add response.data shape guard in searchPatientChart\n- Add console.error logging on all error paths\n- Add 5 new tests: concurrent-call guard, streaming onError, signal.aborted\n  on stopCurrent, blank-bubble removal, voice blocked while loading\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(api): correct SSE buffer flush and test shape for searchPatientChart\n\n- Move unconditional dispatchEvent() outside the buffer block so events\n  accumulated before the final chunk (trailing \\n case) are not lost\n- Update abort-signal test mock to include a valid answer field to match\n  the new response shape guard\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: apply linter formatting fixes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(test): reorder imports in ai-search-panel test\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ui): show disclaimer once as panel footer instead of per-message\n\nMove disclaimer out of AiResponsePanel into AiSearchPanel as a single\npersistent strip above the input, shown after the first response.\nPanel now grows dynamically up to a max-height of 32rem.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(disclaimer): define AI disclaimer as static translatable string\n\nRemove disclaimer field from API response type and ChatMessage; define\nthe disclaimer text as a hardcoded i18n string in the panel component,\nshown once after the first completed answer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (test) Fix lint errors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (feat) Improve inline citation rendering and disclaimer styling\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a6f83be077020a37e8cabd73f12137f8b276d8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/git/trees/9a6f83be077020a37e8cabd73f12137f8b276d8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-chartsearchai/git/commits/167b4b4e4d898fd3daef1a3bda65fed71303fc1b","verification":{"payload":"tree 9a6f83be077020a37e8cabd73f12137f8b276d8e\nparent 5eaa1d096d66636465fa0890efbac79765e6436a\nauthor Nethmi Rodrigo <nethmi@openmrs.org> 1776345640 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776345640 +0300\n\n(feat) Redesign AI chart search panel as persistent chat history (#3)\n\n* refactor(hook): replace single-answer state with messages array in useChartSearchAi\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(ui): redesign AI Chart Search panel as persistent chat history\n\n* fix(chat-history): address pre-merge issues from code review\n\n- Fix stopCurrent race: use inFlightMessageIdRef to target message by ID\n- Remove empty message bubble when stop fires before any answer arrives\n- Null abortControllerRef on unmount to prevent hook lock on remount\n- Add isMountedRef guard to skip state updates after unmount\n- Fix SSE buffer flush to process all remaining lines, not just first\n- Add try/catch + rethrow to submitFeedback for error visibility\n- Add response.data shape guard in searchPatientChart\n- Add console.error logging on all error paths\n- Add 5 new tests: concurrent-call guard, streaming onError, signal.aborted\n  on stopCurrent, blank-bubble removal, voice blocked while loading\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(api): correct SSE buffer flush and test shape for searchPatientChart\n\n- Move unconditional dispatchEvent() outside the buffer block so events\n  accumulated before the final chunk (trailing \\n case) are not lost\n- Update abort-signal test mock to include a valid answer field to match\n  the new response shape guard\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: apply linter formatting fixes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(test): reorder imports in ai-search-panel test\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ui): show disclaimer once as panel footer instead of per-message\n\nMove disclaimer out of AiResponsePanel into AiSearchPanel as a single\npersistent strip above the input, shown after the first response.\nPanel now grows dynamically up to a max-height of 32rem.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(disclaimer): define AI disclaimer as static translatable string\n\nRemove disclaimer field from API response type and ChatMessage; define\nthe disclaimer text as a hardcoded i18n string in the panel component,\nshown once after the first completed answer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (test) Fix lint errors\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (feat) Improve inline citation rendering and disclaimer styling\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp4OIoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIm8QAHxKLJrGUInBgJBzvKjVwAfD\nVOKNvHT1yG01aHio3ZNT4YFQHaYM2vB2QRpeTKD3NdY2d0p69WLeF/HbMNyJCGGl\nAElZBZ+4ETcW75Fttyit2qv+PGiokQerw+gnELx86ZhQ4lqQ5llVimCO0tV8bUxo\nczjDOls98nOoEnHprKMFoX0uKFAHhy4WeVLeA7+j7TFvxLEqlE5FZlemORAybKrT\n11eTiOdQ0wiDPJ/Np+J/YXMfzfEG8EQ5Kra1JZY732hjbHA1i0vwOei65E76J5iH\n2SNpasu5yeEnXrNcNmuAT6+1jxFYHN7f5lLsEsAFHpQ5hsQSvYhkzjIjUqQ3ebAh\nSniwVCkgoYcwYwC0QSg7Rm45Q2vrf0S2zpNuGm595DUPFptMYb5qNFXiCTLMrkNy\nTIHmxpzA9yCIdmw1TKYN6kn+Un6Pw10+fz5VLze0QpAeBtOgeNtfICwqi6VvyXJf\nNHi/j7mArhU/vYbyiZ9pOINq9e/OTYMly+b2XNdOuIq+Q1tujeOYJFegcmAX2TAc\nr71xqA0/SRXdhl82c/NoBSbSgRHrftwEaWDyx+WT3wpq6rH+nCZnm0ck5whcVU8V\n+J6Ddc2PDz7D4eWUOmg/UaLt9hNeJ5Zty6sKKgoed8WW9FEhwbcPR3kLYcZHQPiz\nZcOYpc7t4TK5aQf4mggp\n=G0oX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-16T13:20:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/star